(1366,'biology',100,556,1114,'The amnion of mammalian embryo is derived from<br>','[{"text": "Mesoderm and trophoblast", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Endoderm and mesoderm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ectoderm and mesoderm", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Ectoderm and endoderm", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Amnion is an extraembryonic membrane, its function is to prevent dessication of embryo and act as shock absorber.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2018,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
