(1521,'biology',100,556,1113,'Which of the following hormones is not secreted by human placenta?','[{"text": "Progestogen", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "hCG", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "FSH", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Relaxin", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'FSH is secreted by the anterior pituitary gland.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2022,'KCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1533,'biology',100,551,1105,'Which of the following is not a paired structure in male?','[{"text": "Urethra", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Vas deferens", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Epididymis", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ejaculatory duct", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Urethra is not a paired structure in male. The urethra is a tube that connects the urinary bladder to the urethral meatus for the removal of fluids from the body. In male, the urethra travels through the penis, and carries semen as well as urine and in female, the urethra is shorter and emerges at the female external urethral orifice above the vaginal opening.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1522,'biology',106,1356,3259,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">The Amazon rain forest harbouring probably millions of species is being cut and cleared for cultivating soya beans or for conversion to grasslands for raising beef cattle.<br></div><div class="column-right">When large habitats are broken up into small fragments due to various human activities, mammals and birds requiring large territories and certain animals with migratory habits are affected, leading to gradual population inclines.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Statement A is correct and statement B is wrong. When large habitats are broken up into small fragments due to various human activities, mammals and birds requiring large territories and certain animals with migratory habits are badly affected, leading to population declines.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
