(1525,'biology',100,551,1105,'The testis are situated outside the abdominal cavity in scortum as in helps to','[{"text": "Maintain the low temperature", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Store sperm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Regulates hormone secretion", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Release sperm", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The testis are situated outside the abdominal cavity in scrotum as it helps to maintain the low temperature about $2.5 \\mathrm{C}$ lower than body temperature for spermatogenesis.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2022,'KCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1526,'biology',106,1356,3259,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Many species extinctions in the last 500 years (Steller\'s sea cow, passenger pigeon) were due to over exploitation by humans.<br></div><div class="column-right">Presently many marine fish populations around the world are over harvested, endangering the continued extinction of some commercially important species.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Statement A is correct and statement B is wrong. Presently many marine fish populations around the world are over harvested, endangering the continued existence of some commercially important species.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1527,'biology',105,1277,3094,'Which of the following forest plants controls the light conditions at the ground?','[{"text": "Lianas and climbers", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Shrubs", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Tall trees", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Herbs", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Tall trees form dense canopy and thus control the amount of light which reaches the ground.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,'NCERT Exemplar','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1528,'biology',103,970,2257,'Use of Cannabis products results in','[{"text": "Stimulation of nervous system thus increases alertness and activity", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Suppressed brain function and relief in pain", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Depressed brain activity and feeling of calmness", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Alteration of perception, thoughts and feeling", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Hallucination is a perception of an object in its absence. Hashish is an extract of cannabis. It consists of a psychoactive constituent. It distorts the ability to think and react. It affects the perception of thought in the forebrain. It is a concentrated drug which can alter thoughts and feelings.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1529,'biology',100,551,1105,'Which of the following statements regarding Sertoli cell is correct?','[{"text": "It is found in seminiferous tubule and secretes testosterone hormone.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It is a place where spermatozoa is concentrated and stored until ejaculation.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It secretes spermatozoa activating substances like fructose, citrate, inositol, prostaglandin and protein.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It is found in seminiferous tubule and functions as nurse cells for differentiating spermatozoa.", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Sertoli cell is found in seminiferous tubule and functions as nurse cells for differentiating spermatozoa.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1530,'biology',106,1356,3259,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">When alien species are introduced unintentionally or deliberately for whatever purpose, some of them cause decline or extinction of indigenous species.<br></div><div class="column-right">The Nile perch introduced into Lake Victoria in West Africa led eventually to the extinction of an ecologically unique assemblage of more than 200 species of cichlid fish in the lake.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Statement A is correct and statement B is wrong. The Nile perch introduced into Lake Victoria in east Africa led eventually to the extinction of an ecologically unique assemblage of more than 200 species of cichlid fish in the lake.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
