(1532,'biology',103,970,2257,'The drug that produces profound cardiovascular effects in human beings is','[{"text": "Cocaine", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ganja", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Smack", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ethanol", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The flower tops, leaves and the resin of cannabis plant are used in various combinations to produce marijuana, hashish, charas and ganja. Generally taken by inhalation and oral ingestion, these are known for their effects on cardiovascular system of the body.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1534,'biology',106,1356,3259,'Match the following:<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">The illegal introduction of the African catfish<br><em>Clarias gariepinus</em> for aquaculture purposes is posing a threat to the indigenous catfishes in our rivers.</div><div class="column-right">Invasive weed species like wheat grass (<em>Parthenium</em>), <em>Lantana</em> and water hyacinth (<em>Eicchornia</em>) are creating huge problems.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Both the statements are correct. The environmental damage caused and threat posed to our native species by invasive weed species like carrot grass (<em>Parthenium</em>), Lantana and water hyacinth <em>(Eicchornia)</em>. The recent illegal introduction of the African catfish<em> Clarias gariepinus</em> for aquaculture purposes is posing a threat to the indigenous catfishes in our rivers.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1535,'biology',105,1280,3097,'A population has more young individuals compared to the older individuals. What would be the status of the population after some years?','[{"text": "It will decline", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It will stabilise", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It will increase", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "It will first decline and then stabilise", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'A higher portion of young population means birth rate is higher than mortality and hence population will grow.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,'NCERT Exemplar','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1536,'biology',103,970,2257,'Which plant is responsible for hallucination?','[{"text": "<i>Atropa Beladona</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Datura</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Erythroxylum coca</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of the given options", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Hallucinogens: These are psychedelic or vision producing drugs. These drugs have a strong effect on the cerebrum and sense organs take the user to a world of fantasy giving him false and temporary happiness. These drugs cause hallucination (seeing objects which are actually not present)',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1537,'biology',100,552,1106,'Which of the following is a finger like structure and lies at the upper junction of the two labia minora above the urethral opening?','[{"text": "Clitoris", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Oviduct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ampulla", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fimbriae", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Clitoris is a small, sensitive, erectile part of the female genitals at the anterior end of the vulva. It is homologous to the penis.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1538,'biology',106,1356,3259,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">When a species becomes extinct, the plant and animal species associated with it in an obligatory way also become extinct.<br></div><div class="column-right">When a host fish species becomes extinct, its unique assemblage of parasites also meets the same fate.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Both the statements are correct. When a species becomes extinct, the plant and animal species associated with it in an obligatory way also become extinct. When a host fish species becomes extinct, its unique assemblage of parasites also meets the same fate.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
