(1541,'biology',100,553,1108,'Which of the following contains a fluid filled cavity called antrum?','[{"text": "Primary spermatocyte", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Primary follicle", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Tertiary follicle", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Secondary spermatocyte", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In biology, antrum is a general term for a cavity or chamber, which may have specific meaning in reference to certain organs or sites in the body. Tertiary follicle of ovary contains a fluid filled cavity called antrum and a secondary oocyte ready for ovulation.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1542,'biology',106,1357,3260,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">In the case of a coevolved plant-pollinator mutualism, extinction of one invariably leads to the extinction of the other.<br></div><div class="column-right">More than 75 per cent of the drugs currently sold in the market worldwide are derived from plants and 55,000 species of plants contribute to the traditional medicines used by native peoples around the world.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Statement A is correct and statement B is wrong. More than 25 per cent of the drugs currently sold in the market worldwide are derived from plants and 25,000 species of plants contribute to the traditional medicines used by native peoples around the world.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
