(1545,'biology',100,555,1111,'Human female has $44+X X$ chromosomes. The secondary oocyte shall have','[{"text": "$44+\\\\mathrm{XX}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$22+X$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "22", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "44", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'In humans a total of 23 pairs of chromosomes are found of which 22 pairs are autosomes and one pair sex chromosomes. Hence, after meiosis I secondary oocyte has 22+ X chromosomes',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
