(2206,'biology',103,964,2246,'Given below are some reasons which affect health of human beings. Identify the correct ones.<br>$\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}\n{{\\rm{I}}{\\rm{.}}\\,{\\rm{Genetic}}\\,{\\rm{disorders}}\\,\\,\\,}&{{\\rm{II}}{\\rm{.}}\\,{\\rm{Infections}}\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,}\\\\\n{{\\rm{III}}{\\rm{.}}\\,{\\rm{Life}}\\,{\\rm{styles}}\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,}&{{\\rm{IV}}{\\rm{.}}\\,{\\rm{Mental}}\\,{\\rm{state}}}\n\\end{array}$','[{"text": "I, II and III", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "II, III and IV", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "I, III and V", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of these", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Health is the state of being free from illness or injury. Mind and mental state can affect the health. Health is also affected by genetic disorders, infections, and life style including food and water we take, rest and exercise we give to our bodies, habits that we have or lack.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
