(2233,'biology',73,148,337,'Metabolism can be best defined as','[{"text": "The process in which a chemical is formed inside the body", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The process in which a chemical is destroyed inside the body", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The sum of total of all chemical reactions occuring in the body", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A complex construction process only", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Metabolism is the some of total of all the metabolic activities (chemical reactions) occuring in the body, i.e. anabolism and catabolism. Anabolism is a constructive process, while catabolism is a destructive process.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
