ay}{*{20}{c}}\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\left( {{\\\\rm{ii}}} \\\\right){\\\\mkern 1mu}{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\rm{Cannabi - }}}\\n\\\\end{array}}\\\\\\\\\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\rm{noid}}}\\n\\\\end{array}}\\n\\\\end{array}}\\n\\\\end{array}}&{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\,\\\\,\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{Atropa}\\n\\\\end{array}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,}\\\\\\\\\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{belladonna}\\n\\\\end{array}\\\\,\\\\,}\\n\\\\end{array}\\\\,\\\\,}\\n\\\\end{array}}&{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} \\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{{\\\\rm{Produces}}{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} }\\n\\\\end{array}{\\\\mkern 1mu} }\\\\\\\\\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\,{\\\\rm{allucinations}}}\\n\\\\end{array}}\\n\\\\end{array}}\\n\\\\end{array}}\\n\\\\end{array}$<br><br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}\\n{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n\\\\begin{array}{l}\\n\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\,\\\\left( {\\\\rm{i}} \\\\right){\\\\rm{ Morphine}}}\\n\\\\end{array}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\\\\\\\n\\n\\\\end{array}\\n\\\\end{array}}&{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n\\\\begin{array}{l}\\n\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{Papaver}\\n\\\\end{array}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{somniferum}\\n\\\\end{array}\\\\,\\\\,\\n\\\\end{array}\\n\\\\end{array}}&{\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n\\\\begin{array}{l}\\n\\\\,\\\\,\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{{\\\\rm{Sedative}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{and}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,}\\n\\\\end{array}\\\\,\\\\\\\\\\n{\\\\kern 1pt} \\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\rm{pain}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{killer}}}\\n\\\\end{array}\\n\\\\end{array}\\n\\\\end{array}}\\n\\\\end{array}$", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Molecule (i) represents structure of morphine. Morphine is a sedative and pain killer.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ t