(2287,'biology',11,297,570,'Which of the following statement is incorrect?','[{"text": "Nucleic acids carry hereditary information and are passed on from parental generation to progeny.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Coenzyme nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (NAD) and NADP contains the vitamin niacin.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Enzymes lower the activation energy of reactions and enhance greatly the rate of the reactions.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The energy level difference between S and P. If ‘S’ is at a lower level than ‘P’, the reaction is an exothermic reaction", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'The energy level difference between S and P. If ‘P’ is at a lower level than ‘S’, the reaction is an exothermic reaction',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
