(2295,'biology',11,297,567,'Consider the following statements. Choose the incorrect option.','[{"text": "The enzyme itself is unchanged in the reaction, its presence allows the reaction to take place.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Higher activation energy helps the molecules to react with greater rate.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Enzymes lower the activation energy of the reaction", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The enzyme breaks bonds of substrate to release the product and free itself for another molecule of substrate.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Enzymes lower the activation energy of the reaction. Lower activation energy increases the rate of reaction.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(2297,'biology',103,970,2257,'Read the following statements :<br>Read the statements A and statement B carefully to mark the correct options given below.<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Morphine is obtained by acetylation of Heroin.</div><div class="column-right">Cannabinoids are known for their effect on cardiovascular system<br></div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Statement-A is incorrect. \'Because, Heroin-a type of opiod drug. It is commonly called smack and chemically it is diacetylmorphine, which is a white, odourless, bitter crystalline compound. This is obtained by acetylation of morphine.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',2024,'KCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
