(2623,'biology',74,248,490,'Single celled eukaryotes are included in','[{"text": "Archaea", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fungi", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Monera", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Protista", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Protista include all unicellular and colonial eukaryotes except those of green and red algae. The protistan cells are typical eukaryotic cells having membrane bound organelles like mitochondria, chloroplasts, golgi bodies, endoplasmic reticulum. Protista are called kingdom of unicellular eukaryotes.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2010,'AIPMT','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
