(2854,'biology',73,148,337,'Metabolism is','[{"text": "Release of energy", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Gain of energy", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Release or gain of energy", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Catabolism of a reaction", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Living things exhibit a rapid turnover of chemical materials, which is referred to as metabolism. Metabolism involves exchange of chemical matter with the external environment and extensive transformations of organic matter within the cells of a living organism. Metabolism generally involves the release or use of chemical energy. Non-living things do not display metabolism.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
