(2953,'biology',73,149,338,'Which taxonomic term may be suggested for any rank in the classification?','[{"text": "Class", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Order", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Species", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Taxon", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'A taxon refers to a category, rank or a unit of classification. Each category is a biological entity in itself. For example, tiger and animal both represent taxa. But tiger is an animal. This indicates that taxa refer to categories at different levels.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2013,'kcet','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
