(3084,'biology',74,248,490,'Consider the following statements<br> A. Members of protista are primarily aquatic<br> B. Boundaries of kingdom protista are well defined<br> C. Protistan cell body contains a well defined nucleus<br> D. Some protists have flagella or cilia<br> How many statements is/are correct?','[{"text": "One", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Two", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Three", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Four", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Most of the members of the Protista are found in water. Boundary of the kingdom is not so properly known.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
