(3437,'biology',76,848,1891,'____ lack vessels in their xylem.','[{"text": "Angiosperms", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Algae", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Gymnosperms", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Bryophytes", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Gymnospems lack vessels in their xylem, Vessel is a long cylindrical tube-like structure made up of many cells called vessel members, each with lignified walls and a large central cavity. The presence of vessels is a characteristic feature of angiosperms.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
