(3731,'biology',11,290,558,'The sugar present in milk is:','[{"text": "Sucrose", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fructose", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Lactose", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Glucose", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Lactose $\\left(\\mathrm{C}_{12} \\mathrm{H}_{22} \\mathrm{O}_{11}\\right)$ is commonly known as milk sugar. It is made by condensation of $(\\beta 1 \\rightarrow 4)$ glucose and galactose.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2010,'kcet','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
