(3733,'biology',76,850,1892,'Subsidiary cells are the specialised cell in the','[{"text": "Vicinity of guard cells", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Covering the stomata", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Covering the stomatal cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Vicinity of trichomes", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Sometimes, a few epidermal cells in the vicinity of the guard cells become specialised in their shape and size and are known as subsidiary cells.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
