(3740,'biology',74,248,495,'Common feature of <i>Amoeba, Euglena, Paramoecium</i> and <i>Trypanosoma</i> is','[{"text": "Being eukaryotic", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Holozoic nutrition", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Multiple fission", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Prokaryotes", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Common feature of Amoeba, Euglena, Paramoecium and Trypanosoma is being eukaryotic. Euglena exhibits autotrophism in presence of sunlight.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
