(3868,'biology',75,719,1518,'When the margin of thalamus grows upward enclosing the ovary completely and getting fused with it, the other parts of flower arise above the ovary, the flower is called','[{"text": "Hypogynous flower", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Perigynous flower", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Epigynous flower", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Agynous flower", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In epigynous flowers, the margin of thalamus grows upward enclosing the ovary completely and getting fused with it, the other parts of flower arise above the ovary.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
