(3934,'biology',76,851,1895,'Match the columns I and II.<br><div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. Dicot root<br>B. Monocot root</div><div class="column-right">P. Pith is large or conspicuous<br>Q. 2-4 xylem bundles<br>R. More than six xylem bundles<br>S. Pith is small or inconspicuous<br>T. Secondary growth</div></div>','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{Q}, \\\\mathrm{S}, \\\\mathrm{T} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{R}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{Q}, \\\\mathrm{T} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{S}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{Q} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{S}, \\\\mathrm{T}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{S} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{Q}, \\\\mathrm{T}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Dicot root - 2-4 xylem bundles, pith is small or inconspicuous, secondary growth Monocot root - Pith is large or conspicuous, more than 6 xylem bundles (polyarch).',NULL,'Easy','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
