(4019,'biology',76,853,1897,'What is the characteristics of a vascular bundle of monocot stem?','[{"text": "Open and not surrounded by a bundle sheath", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Open and surrounded by a parenchymatous bundle sheath", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Closed and surrounded by collenchymatous bundle sheath", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Closed and surrounded by a sclerenchymatous bundle sheath", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Vascular bundle is enclosed within a well developed sclerenchymatous sheath in monocot stem. It does not show presence of cambium hence it\'s vascular bundle is of closed type.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
