(4021,'biology',77,412,822,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> ${G_2}$ phase is mainly concerned with protein synthesis and RNA synthesis.<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> DNA duplication occurs once in mitosis and once in meiosis.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Proteins and RNAs are synthesized in ${G_2}$ phase during interphase. Photosystem &ndash; I is situated on the inner surface of thylakoid.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
