(4034,'biology',77,412,822,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> Interphase is divisible into 3 stages ${G_1}$, S and ${G_2}$ phases.<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> S-phase is also called invisible M-phase.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Interphase has three stages ${G_1}$, S and ${G_2}$. S - Phase is also called invisible phase of M- phase since it is in this phase that the chromosomes prepare themselves for equitable distribution later on. During the S-phase, the genetic material of every chromosome is replicated.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
