(4215,'biology',74,246,488,'In the five kingdom classification, which kingdom found a appropriate place?','[{"text": "Plantae", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Algae", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Protista", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fungi", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'In 5 kingdom classification, the fungi were placed in a separate kingdom – Kingdom Fungi.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(4216,'biology',77,418,834,'At which stage of meiosis does the genetic constitution of gametes is finally decided','[{"text": "Metaphase I", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Anaphase II", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Metaphase II", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Anaphase I", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'In Anaphase I of meiosis, each homologous chromosome with its two chromatids and undivided centromere; moves to the opposite poles of the cell. So the actual reduction occurs in this stage which decides the genetic constitution of gamete',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,'NCERT Exemplar','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
