(4361,'biology',77,418,834,'Select the correct statement regarding the phase of meiosis II represented by given diagram_','[{"text": "Homologous chromosome separates", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Sister chromatids remain associated with centromere", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Shortening of microtubules and separation of sister chromatids", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Alignment of homologous chromosomes at equator", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The given figure represents Anaphase-II of Meiosis-II. It begins with the simultaneous splitting of the centromere of each chromosome (which was holding the sister chromatids together), allowing them to move toward opposite poles of the cell by shortening of microtubules attached to kinetochores.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/77_4361_question_1.png'),
(4348,'biology',77,418,834,'Match the columns I and II and choose the correct option.<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. M -phase<br>B. Mitosis<br>C. Prophase<br>D. Meiosis</div><div class="column-right">P. First stage of karyokinesis of mitosis<br>Q. Most dramatic period of the cell cycle<br>R. Conservation of specific chromosome number of each species<br>S. Equational division</div></div>','[{"text": "A-R,  B-P, C-Q, D-S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A-S, B-P, C-Q, D-R", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A-Q, B-P, C-R, D-S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A-Q,  B-S, C-P, D-R", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'A. (Q) M-Phase is the most dramatic period of the cell cycle, involving a major reorganisation of virtually all components of the cell.<br>B. (S) Mitosis is called as the equational division because it divides the parent cell into two identical daughter cells, each with a nucleus having the same chromosomal content as in the parent cell.<br>C.(P) Prophase isthefirst stage of karyokinesis of mitosis.<br>D. (R) Meiosis is the mechanism by which conservation of specific chromosome number of each species is achieved across generations in sexually reproducing organisms.',NULL,'Easy','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
