(4356,'biology',74,246,488,'Choose the pair of kingdoms of Whittaker\'s classification that show more heterogeneous nature.','[{"text": "Monera, Protista", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Protista, Fungi", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Monera, Fungi", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fungi, Animalia", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Monera are heterogenous group as many have cell wall and some not, all types of nutritions are shown by them, some are photosynthetic and some are nonphotosynthetic. Similarly Protistans have cell wall or without cell wall, photosynthetic or non photosynthetic and have various types of body movements.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
