(4721,'biology',76,848,1890,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Parenchyma forms the minor component within organs.<br></div><div class="column-right">The cells of the parenchyma are generally isodiametric.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Parenchyma forms the major component within organs.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(4722,'biology',77,413,824,'Morphology of chromosomes can be best studied at','[{"text": "Prophase", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Metaphase", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Anaphase", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Telophase", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'During metaphase, condensation of chromosomes is complete and they can be observed clearly under the microscope. This then, is the stage at which morphology of chromosomes is most easily studied.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
