(4773,'biology',77,413,823,'Number of chromosomes in the parent and progency cells is same, it is known as','[{"text": "Reductional division", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Equational division", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both equational and reductional division", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Neither equational nor reductional division", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'During mitosis, since the number of chromosomes in the parent and progeny cells is the same, it is also called as equational division.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(4774,'biology',76,848,1891,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Bastfibres are made up of sclerenchymatous cells.<br></div><div class="column-right">Phloem fibres are made up of sclerenchymatous cells.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Both the statements are correct. Phloem fibres (bast fibres) are made up of sclerenchymatous cells. These are generally absent in the primary phloem but are found in the secondary phloem',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
