(5066,'biology',77,414,827,'Given below is a schematic break-up of the phases / stages of cell cycle with few parts labelled as A, B, C & D.','[{"text": "C-Karyokinesis", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "D - Synthetic phase", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A - Cytokinesis", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "B - Metaphase", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'In schematic break-up of the phases/ stages of cell cycle, D-synthetic phase is the correct indication of the stage/phase in the cell cycle.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/77_5066_question_1.png'),
