(5177,'biology',76,854,1898,'Grass leaves curl inwards during very dry weather. Select the most appropriate reason from the following<br>','[{"text": "Closure of stomata", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Flaccidity of bulliform cells", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Shrinkage of air spaces in spongy mesophyll", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Tyloses in vessels", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Bulliform cells become flaccid due to water loss. This will make the leaves to curl inward to minimise water loss',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2019,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(5179,'biology',75,721,1525,'Read the following statements and find out the incorrect statement about dicotyledonous seed.','[{"text": "The seed coat has two layers, the outer testa and the inner tegmen.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Above the hilum is a small pore called the micropyle", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "At the two ends of embryonal axis are present the radicle and plunule", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "In castor the endosperm formed as a food storing tissue is formed due to double circulation", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'In castor the endosperm formed as a food storing tissue is formed due to double fertilisation.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(5182,'biology',76,848,1891,'Match column-I with column-II.<br><div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. Cells with active cell division capacity<br>B. Tissue having all cells similar in structure and function<br>C. Tissue having different types of cells<br>D. Dead cells with highly thickened walls and narrow lumen</div><div class="column-right">P. Vascular tissues<br>Q. Meristematic tissue<br>R. Sclereids<br>S. Simple tissue</div></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{A - Q,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{B - S,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{C - P,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{D - R}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A - S,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{B - R,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{C - Q,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{D - P}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A - P,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{B - Q,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{C - R,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{D - S}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A - R,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{B - Q,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{C - S,}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{D - P}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Cells with active cell division Meristematic tissue<br>Tissue having all cells similar in structure and function - simple tissue<br>Tissue having different types of cells -Vascular tissues<br>Dead cells with highly thickened walls and narrow lumen - Sclereids.',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',2021,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
