(5897,'biology',8,153,326,'The number of pollen mother cells, and megaspore mother cells required for the formation of 403 male and female gametes respectively','[{"text": "51 & 403", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "101 & 59", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "50 & 403", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "101 & 101", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Each pollen mother cell produce 4 pollen grain by meiosis, ecah pollen grain produce 2 male gamete by 2 mitotic division thus for the formation of 403 male gametes 51 pollen mother cell required.Each megaspore mother cell produced only one egg (female gamete) thus for the formation of 403 female gametes 403 MMC required.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
