(6040,'biology',75,718,1517,'Read the Assertion and Reason carefully to mark the correct options given below:<br><br><strong>Assertion:</strong> A flower is defined as modified shoot wherein the shoot apical meristem changes to floral meristem.<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> Internode of the shoot gets condensed to produce different floral appendages laterally at successive node instead of leaves.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are  true and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are true but Reason is not the correct explanation of Assertion", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is true but Reason is false.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is false but  Reason is true", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Both Assertion and Reason are  true and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion. A flower is a modified shoot wherein the shoot apical meristem changes to floral meristem.<br>Internodes do not elongate and the axis gets condensed. The apex produces different kinds of floral appendages laterally at the successive nodes instead of leaves.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',2023,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6041,'biology',8,154,327,'One advantage of cleistogamy is','[{"text": "It leads to the greater gentic diversity", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Seed set is not dependent on pollinators", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Seed dispersal is more efficient and widespread", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Each visit of a pollinator result in transfer of hundred of pollen grains", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'One advantage of cleistogamy is seed set is not dependent on pollinators.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
