(6045,'biology',8,154,327,'Autogamy can occur in a chasmogamous flower if:','[{"text": "Pollen matures before maturity of ovule", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ovules mature before maturity of pollen", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both pollen and ovules mature simultaneously", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both anther and stigma are of equal lengths.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Relative lengths of stigma and anther are not the only factors, time of maturity of pollens and ovules is also important in deciding the type of pollination. If pollens mature before ovules; they will become ineffective by the time the ovule matures.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,'NCERT Exemplar','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6046,'biology',75,720,1524,'Fleshy fruits with stony endocarp are called:','[{"text": "Berries", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pomes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Drupes", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Capsules", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Drupe is one-seeded fruit formed from monocarpellary superior ovaries. Its pericarp is divided into thin epicarp, fleshy mesocarp and stony endocarp. Because of its stony endocarp, it is also known as stone fruit. For example, coconut, mango.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2009,'kcet','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
