(6189,'biology',8,154,328,'Study the following statements and select the correct one<br> i. Tapetum nourishes  the developing pollen grains<br> ii. Hilum represents the junction between ovule and Funicle<br> iii. In aquatic plants such as water hyacinth and water lily, pollination occurs by water<br> iv. The primary endosperm nucleus is triploid','[{"text": "i and ii are correct but iii and iv are incorrect", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i, ii and iv are correct but iii is incorrect", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "ii, iii and iv are correct but i is incorrect", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i and iv are correct but ii and iii are incorrect", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The statements can be corrected as<br> iii. In aquatic plants such as water hyacinth and water lily, pollination occurs by air.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6190,'biology',81,1045,2468,'How many substrate level phosphorylations take place in one turn of TCA cycle?','[{"text": "4", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "3", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "2", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'1 substrate level phosphorylations take place in one turn of TCA cycle. During the conversion of succinyl-CoA to succinic acid a molecule of GTP is synthesised. This is a substrate level phosphorylation.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6193,'biology',8,154,328,'Which one of the following is not a correct explanation of cross pollination','[{"text": "Pollen grains of male flower are transferred to stigma of the female flower", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pollen grains of one flower are transferred to stigma of the same flower", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Pollen grains are transferred from one flower to another flower situated on different plant", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pollen grains are transferred from one flower to another flower of another plant of same species", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Pollen grains of one flower are transferred to stigma of the same flower is autogamy',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
