(6253,'biology',81,1045,2468,'Who found out the steps involved in TCA Cycle?','[{"text": "Hans Kreb\'s", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Embden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pasteur", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Parnas Krebs", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The acetyl CoA enters a cyclic pathway, tricarboxylic acid cycle, more commonly called as Kreb\'s cycle after the scientist Hans Krebs who first elucidated it.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6254,'biology',8,154,328,'The term used for transfer of pollen grains from anthers of one plant to stigma of a different plant which, during pollination, brings genetically different types of pollen grains to stigma, is :','[{"text": "Xenogamy", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Geitonogamy", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Chasmogamy", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cleistogamy", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Xenogamy is a cross pollination in which pollen grain from anther of one flower to the stigma of another flower are transferred in order to get fertilized.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',2021,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
