(6364,'biology',81,1043,2466,'In hurdle race, which of the following is accumulated in the leg muscle?','[{"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ethanol", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Lactic acid", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Acetaldehyde", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Due to the excessive contraction of muscles (e.g. leg muscles in hurdle race), the metabolic products of glycolysis, i.e. pyruvate is converted into lactic acid/lactate. This gets accumulated in the muscles and leads to muscle fatigue. Due to this, pain is experienced in the fatigued muscle.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
