(6434,'biology',81,1042,2465,'Phosphorylation of glucose during glycolysis is followed by isomerisation, the new compound formed is','[{"text": "Fructo-6-phosphate", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "2-phosphoglyceric acid", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Dehydroxy acetone phosphate", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Phosphoenolpyruvic acid", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The phosphorylated form of glucose then isomerises to produce fructose-6- phosphate.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6435,'biology',82,1262,3077,'Which of the following parts of tree have limited dimensions, fall periodically and some time repeatedly?','[{"text": "The leaves, flowers and fruits", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "The stem, leaves and flowers", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The stem, root and twigs", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The leaves, fruits and roots", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Trees continue to increase in height or girth over a period of time. However, the leaves, flowers and fruits of the same tree have limited dimensions and also appear and fall periodically and some time repeatedly.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6436,'biology',8,156,332,'Triple fusion is characteristic of','[{"text": "Bryophytes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Thallophytes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Angiosperms", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Pteridophytes", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Male gamete + secondary Nuclei results in primary endosperm nucleus, this process is known as triple fusion.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6437,'biology',81,1042,2465,'The enzyme which converts sucrose is and is broken down into and','[{"text": "Maltase, fructose, glucose", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Invertase, glucose, fructose", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Invertase, glucose, glucose", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Hexokinase, fructose, glucose", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Sucrose is converted into glucose and fructose by the enzyme, invertase, and these two monosaccharides readily enter the glycolytic pathway.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
