(6440,'biology',81,1042,2465,'Glucose $$\\rightarrow$$ Gluco-6-phosphate occurs due to the enzyme','[{"text": "Hexokinase", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Invertase", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Hydrolase", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Phosphatase", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Glucose and fructose are phosphorylated to give rise to glucose-6- phosphate by the activity of the enzyme hexokinase.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6441,'biology',82,1262,3077,'All plant organs are made up of ____ tissues.','[{"text": "Identical", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Defected", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Variety", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'All plant organs are made up of a variety of tissues; there is relationship between the structure of a cell, a tissue, an organ and the function they perform.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6442,'biology',8,156,332,'Total number of nuclei involved in the double fertilization in angiosperms are','[{"text": "2", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "3", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "4", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "5", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Double fertilization includes fusion of haploid male gamete with the haploid egg (syngamy) and another haploid male gamete fuses with diploid polar nuclei.Hence total number of nucleus involved is Five.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6443,'biology',81,1042,2465,'Glycolysis is not a part of which of the following process?','[{"text": "Aerobic respiration", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Anaerobic respiration", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Alcoholic fermentation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'None of the above',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6444,'biology',82,1262,3077,'Read the following statements carefully and select the correct number of incorrect statements.<br>(a) Trees continue to increase in height or girth over a period of time.<br>(b) There is relationship between the structure of a cell, a tissue, an organ and the function they perform.<br>(c) Descendants of zygote have different structural and functional attributes','[{"text": "a only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "b only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "a and b only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All 3 are correct", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'All the statements given are correct.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6445,'biology',8,156,332,'Entry of pollen tube with two male gametes and tube nucleus through micropyle is','[{"text": "Porogamy", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Mesogamy", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Chalazogamy", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Porogamy is fertilization by the passage of the pollen-tube with two male gametes and tube nucleus through micropyle.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6446,'biology',81,1042,2465,'Glycolysis takes place in the','[{"text": "Cytoplasm of all living cells", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Cytoplasm of all eukaryotic cell", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mitochondria of all living cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mitochondria of all eukaryotic cell", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Glycolysis is a series of reactions that take place in the cytoplasm of all prokaryotes and eukaryotes (i.e. all living cells)',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
