(6450,'biology',82,1262,3077,'Which of the following two processes can be summed as development.','[{"text": "Wilting and swelling", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Growth and differentiation", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Wilting and differentiation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Growth and imbibition", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Development is the sum of two processes: growth and differentiation.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6451,'biology',8,156,332,'Which of the following is result of double fertilization','[{"text": "Endosperm only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Endosperm and embryo", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Endosperm, embryo and Cotyledons", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Double Fertilization is simultaneous occurrence of syngamy and triple fusion.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6452,'biology',81,1042,2465,'Glycolysis occurs in','[{"text": "Anaerobic organism only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Eukaryotic cells only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Prokaryotic cells only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Almost all cells", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Glycolysis occurs in the cytoplasm of the cell and is present in all living organisms',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6453,'biology',82,1262,3077,'The events followed by zygote (fertilized egg) to develop into mature plant follow_','[{"text": "Precise and rarely ordered succession of events", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Random and highly ordered succession of events", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Precise and highly ordered succession of events", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "It\'s unpredictable", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The development of a mature plant from a zygote (fertilised egg) follow a precise and highly ordered succession of events. During this process a complex body organisation is formed that produces roots, leaves, branches, flowers, fruits, and seeds, and eventually they die.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6456,'biology',82,1262,3077,'The factors controlling development of plant are','[{"text": "Intrinsic (internal) only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Extrinsic (external) only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both intrinsic (internal) and extrinsic (external) to the plant", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Environmental only", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The factors governing and controling the developmental processes in plants can be both intrinsic (internal) and extrinsic (external) to the plant.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
