(6521,'biology',82,1262,3077,'Growth, at a cellular level, is principally a consequence of ____','[{"text": "Increase in size of nucleolus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Increase in the amount of protoplasm", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Increase in the amount of ribosomes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Increase in perinuclear space", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Growth, at a cellular level, is principally a consequence of increase in the amount of protoplasm. Since increase in protoplasm is difficult to measure directly, one generally measures some quantity which is more or less proportional to it.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
