(6568,'biology',81,1040,2463,'Identify the organisms that prepare their own food','[{"text": "Plants, cyanobacteria", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Blue - green algae, cyanobacteria", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Blue - green algae, plants", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All are correct", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Only green plants and cyanobacteria can prepare their own food; by the process of photosynthesis, they trap light energy and convert it into chemical energy that is stored in the bonds of carbohydrates like glucose, sucrose and starch.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
