(6577,'biology',83,489,1005,'True segmentation is also called','[{"text": "Eusegmentation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Metasegementation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Metamerism", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Megamerism", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In some animals, the body is externally and internally divided into segments with a serial repetition of at least some organs. This pattern is called true or metameric segmentation and the phenomenon is known as metamerism.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
