(6701,'biology',81,1046,2469,'The NADH synthesised in ____ is transferred into the mitochondria and undergoes','[{"text": "Link; carboxylation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "ETS; oxidative phosphorylation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Glycolysis; oxidative phosphorylation", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "TCA cycle; oxidative decarboxylation", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The NADH synthesised in glycolysis is transferred into the mitochondria and undergoes oxidative phosphorylation.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6702,'biology',82,1263,3078,'In the expression of exponential growth, $\\mathrm{W}_{1}=$ $\\mathrm{W}_{0} \\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{rt}}$, \' $\\mathrm{r}$ \' represents____','[{"text": "Relative growth ratio", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Relative growth rate", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Exponential growth parameter", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The exponential growth can be expressed as $\\mathrm{W}_{1}=\\mathrm{W}_{0} \\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{rt}}$.<br>Efficiency index in the geometrical growth is the ability of plants to produce new plant material, which can be denoted as \'r\' i.e. relative growth rate.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(6703,'biology',83,490,1006,'Which one of the following is a porifera?','[{"text": "<i>Adamsia</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Spirulina</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Euspongia</i>", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "<i>Gorilla</i>", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Some examples of sponges are - <i>Sycon</i> (Scypha), <i>Spongilla</i> (Fresh water sponge) and  <i>Euspongia</i> (Bath sponge).',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
