(6738,'biology',8,157,335,'In the legume seed, food is stored in','[{"text": "Endosperm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cotyledon", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Seed coats", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Perisperm", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'In most of the dicots seeds, endosperm is consumed during seed formation and food is stored in the cotyledons. This type of seeds are called as anon-endospermic or Non albuminous seed.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
