(6851,'biology',8,157,335,'The record of oldest seed dormancy is of','[{"text": "2,000 years", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "15,000 years", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "10,000 years", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "12,000 years", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The oldest is that of a lupine, Lupinus arcticus excavated from Arctic Tundra. The seed germinated and flowered after an estimated record of 10,000 years of dormancy.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
