(6828,'biology',8,157,335,'Choose the wrong statement','[{"text": "Fruits which develop from ovary are called True fruits", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Strawberry is an example for true fruit", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Fruits in which thalamus contributes in the fruit formation is called False Fruit.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fruits which develop without fertilization are called as Parthenocarpic fruits", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'A false fruit or pseudo-carp is derived from the floral parts other than ovary. Strawberry is a kind of false fruit.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
