(6835,'biology',81,1045,2468,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">In TCA cycle, during the conversion of succinyl-CoA to succinic acid a molecule of GTP is synthesised<br></div><div class="column-right">There are three points in the TCA cycle where $$\\mathrm{FAD}^{+}$$is reduced to $$\\mathrm{FADH}_{2}$$ and one point where $$\\mathrm{NAD}^{+}$$is reduced to $$\\mathrm{NADH}+\\mathrm{H}^{+}$$</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'There are three points in the TCA cycle where $$\\mathrm{NAD}^{+}$$is reduced to NADH and $$\\mathrm{H}^{+}$$and one point where $$\\mathrm{FAD}^{+}$$is reduced to $$\\mathrm{FADH}_{2}$$.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
