(7009,'biology',8,152,322,'Corolla in flowering plants refers to the','[{"text": "Collection of carpels", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Collection of sepals", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Collection of petals", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Collection of stamens", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In a flower petals are generally arranged in a circular pattern around the center of the flower, and the collective unit of these petals is referred to as the corolla.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
