(7262,'biology',82,1270,3086,'In tissue culture which PGR find its use','[{"text": "Auxins, cytokinins", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Cytokinins only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Auxins, GA", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "GA, cytokinins", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In tissue culture auxins and cytokinins finds its use. The shoot and root development in culture is controlled by auxin-cytokinin balance. More auxins promote root development and more cytokinins promote shoot development.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
