(7267,'biology',83,495,1011,'Which of the following statement is correct about annelida?','[{"text": "They are triploblastic, metamerically segmented acoelomate animals", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "They possess both longitudinal and circular muscles which help in locomotion", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "An open circulatory system is present", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All are dioecious and reproduction is sexual", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Annelids are triploblastic, metamerically segmented, coelomate animals. They possess both longitudinal and circular muscles that help in locomotion. Closed circulatory system is present. Reproduction is sexual and sexes are not essentially separate.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
