(7300,'biology',82,1271,3087,'Most widely used compound as a source of ethylene is','[{"text": "Acetylene", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ethene", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ethephon", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Ethepcon", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The most widely used compound as source of ethylene is ethephon. Ethephon in an aqueous solution is readily absorbed and transported within the plant and releases ethylene slowly.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(7301,'biology',84,579,1158,'Which of the following options is true about epithelium?','[{"text": "Cells are compactly packed with little intercellular matrix", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Cells are loosley packed with large intercellular matrix", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Always multicellular", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Always unicellular", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Epithelial tissue has a free surface, which faces either a body fluid or the outside environment and thus provides a covering or a lining for some part of the body. The cells are compactly packed with little intercellular matrix.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
