(7310,'biology',83,496,1012,'Identify the following statements and select which phylum they belong to?<br>a. They are mostly dioecious, presence of jointed appendages and segmented<br>b. Fertilisation is usually internal. They are mostly oviparous.<br>c. Development may be direct or indirect.','[{"text": "Annelida", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Arthropoda", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Mollusca", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Echinodermata", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Above mentioned characteristics are that of Arthropods.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
