(7313,'biology',84,579,1158,'Epithelial cells are concerned with','[{"text": "Respiration", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Secretion", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Filtration", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of the above", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Epithelial tissues are widespread throughout the body. They form the covering of all body surfaces, line body cavities and hollow organs, and are the major tissue in glands. They perform a variety of functions that include protection, secretion, absorption, excretion, filtration, diffusion, and sensory reception.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(7314,'biology',83,496,1012,'What is common between earthworm and cockroach?','[{"text": "Nephridia", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Coelomate, triploblastic", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Closed circulation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Malphigian tubule", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Earthworm and cockroach both belong to phylum Arthropoda. They both are coelomate, triploblastic and possess open circulation.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
