(7403,'biology',82,1273,3089,'What kind of plants require the exposure to light for a period less than well defined critical duration?','[{"text": "Short day plants", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Day-neutral plants", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Long day plants", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'It has been observed that some plants require a periodic exposure to light to induce flowering. Short day plants require the exposure to light for a period less than well defined critical duration.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(7404,'biology',83,497,1013,'Phylum mollusca can be distinguished from other invertebrates by the presence of','[{"text": "Shell and non-segmented body", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Bilateral symmetry and exoskeleton", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mantle and gills", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mantle and non-segmented body", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Phylum mollusca can be distinguished from other invertebrates by the presence of mantle and non-segmented body.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(7405,'biology',84,579,1158,'Ciliated columnar epithelium in humans is known to occur in<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "Eustachian tubes and stomach lining", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fallopian tubes and uterus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Oesophagus and fallopian tubes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fallopian tubes and bronchioles", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'If the columnar or cuboidal cells bear cilia on their free surface they are called ciliated epithelium. Their function is to move particles or mucus in a specific direction over the epithelium. They are mainly present in the inner surface of hollow organs like bronchioles and fallopian tubes.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(7407,'biology',82,1273,3089,'Day neutral plants','[{"text": "Show no flowering in any photoperiod", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Show loss of activity during day time", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Have no correlation between exposure to light duration and induction of flowering response", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The critical duration is different for different plants. There are many plants, however, where there is no such correlation between exposure to light duration and induction of flowering response; such plants are called day-neutral plants.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
