(7411,'biology',82,1273,3089,'What is more important of these for flowering?','[{"text": "Light period", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Dark period", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The duration of light period as well as duration of dark period is of equal importance. Hence, it can be said that flowering in certain plants depends not only on a combination of light and dark exposures but also their relative durations.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
