(7742,'biology',82,1266,3081,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Difference in shapes of leaves produced in air and those produced in water in buttercup also represent the heterophyllous development due to phase of life.<br></div><div class="column-right">Development in plants (i.e., both growth and differentiation) is under the control of intrinsic and extrinsic factors.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Difference in shapes of leaves produced in air and those produced in water in buttercup also represent the heterophyllous development due to environment.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
