(7907,'biology',82,1273,3089,'Through their effect on plant growth regulators, what do the temperature and light control in plants?<br>','[{"text": "Fruit elongation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Apical dominance", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Flowering", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Closure of stomata", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Light and temperature affects flowering in plants in various ways, the effects of photoperiods helps in flowering viz Long day plants, Short day plants and Day neutral plants. Vernalisation is also dependant on low temperature and it induces flowering.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2012,'AIPMT','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
