(7915,'biology',82,1268,3084,'The pineapple which is under natural conditions is difficult to blossom, has been made to produce fruits throughout the year by application of<br>','[{"text": "NAA, 2, 4 - D", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Cytokinin", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Phenyl acetic acid", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "IAA, IBA", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'NAA and 2, 4-D are synthetic auxin normally inhibit flowering. It delays flowering and plants can be kept in vegetative period for long time. In mango, litchi, apple and pineapple auxin induces flowering.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2013,'AIPMT','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
