(7918,'biology',83,502,1020,'Due to the absence of air bladder in chondrichthyes','[{"text": "They have to swim constantly to avoid sinking.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "They do not have to swim constantly to avoid sinking.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "They have to swim constantly to avoid being eaten", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of them", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Due to the absence of air bladder, they have to swim constantly to avoid sinking.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(7919,'biology',82,1267,3083,'Dr F. Went noted that if coleoptile tips were removed and placed on agar for one hour, the agar would produce a bending when placed on one side of freshly cut coleoptiles stumps. Of what significance is this experiment?<br>','[{"text": "It is made possible the isolation and exact identification of auxin", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "It is the basis for quantitative determination of small amounts of growth promoting substances.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It supports the hypothesis that IAA is auxin.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It demonstrates polar movement of auxins.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Dr F. Went noted that if coleoptile tips were removed and placed on agar for one hour, the agar would produce a bending when placed on one side of freshly cut coleoptiles stumps. This experiment signifies that it is made possible that isolation and identification of exact identification of auxin. Dr F. Went isolated Auxin from Avena coleoptile tip. His experiment demonstrated the polar movement of auxins. Tryptophan is the precursor of Indole acetic acid (IAA, natural auxin). Important biassay of auxins are Avena curvature test and cross root inhibition test.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2014,'AIPMT','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
