(8114,'biology',82,1271,3087,'Which of the following statement is correct regarding ethylene?','[{"text": "It delays senescence.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It decreases the respiration rate during fruit ripening.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It breaks seed and bud dormancy.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "It inhibits flowering in mango.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Ethylene promotes senescence and abscission of plant organs especially of leaves and flowers. It enhances the respiration rate during fruit ripening. Ethylene is also used to initiate flowering and for synchronizing fruitset in pineapples. It also induces flowering in mango.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(8115,'biology',83,504,1022,'Which of the following is true for all amphibians?','[{"text": "Some have tail", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Body is divisible into head and trunk", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Alimentary canal and urinary and reproductive tracts open into common chambers to the exterior", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of them", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'All the mentioned features are characteristics of the phylum Amphibia.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(8130,'biology',83,505,1023,'Which features are common to the animals belonging to class-Amphibia and classReptilia?','[{"text": "The presence of scales and four-chambered heart", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The presence of tympanum, poikilotherms", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "The presence of cloaca", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Skin is moist", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The presence of tympanum is common to both amphibians and reptiles. Both of them are cold blooded organisms.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(8118,'biology',83,504,1022,'Choose the incorrect statement.','[{"text": "Amphibians are first vertebrates to invade land and fully adapted to terrestrial life", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Fertilization is internal in reptiles", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Reptiles are poikilothermal", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Amphibians skin is moist and without scales", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Amphibians are the first vertebrates to invade land, but they are incompletely adapted to terrestrial life. Reptiles are the first vertebrates to invade land and adapt fully to terrestrial life',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(8120,'biology',82,1272,3088,'During water stress, rise in ABA levels initially cause','[{"text": "Stomatal opening", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Stomatal closure", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Increased transpiration", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Reduced transpiration", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'During water stress, rise in ABA levels initially causes stomatal closure.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
