(8575,'biology',83,504,1022,'In the given list how many animals have vertebral column, cranium, jaw<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "Five", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Four", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Six", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Three", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Sea horse, frog, snake, Torpedo have vertebral column, cranium and jaw. Haggis and Petromyzon lack jaw (Agnatha). Herdmania is a member of Urochordata. It lacks vertebral column, cranium and jaw. Amphioxus, is member of Cephalochordata. It lacks vertebral column, cranium and jaw.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/83_8575_question_1.png'),
