(8703,'biology',86,982,2287,'Factors affecting the rate of diffusion is/are','[{"text": "Solubility of gases", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pressure gradient", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Thickness of membranes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of these", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Pressure/concentration gradient, solubility of gases as well as thickness of the membranes involved in diffusion affects the rate of diffusion. For example, $$\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$$ is $$20-25 \\%$$ more soluble than $$\\mathrm{O}_{2}$$ due to which the former diffuses faster across diffusion membrane.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
