(8990,'biology',84,583,1171,'The number of vasa efferntia that arises from testes in frog\'s male reproductive system is','[{"text": "$10-20$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$10-12$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$10-16$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$10-14$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'In frog, vasa efferentia are 10-12 in number that arise from testes. They enter the kidneys on their side and open into Bidder\'s canal.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
