(9117,'biology',87,1122,2694,'Following diagram shows different types of cells (1-6). How many cells are granulocytes and agranulocytes respectively?','[{"text": "3,2", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "2,4", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1,5", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "3,3", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Given diagram can be labelled as 1-basophil, 2- monocyte, 3- T-lymphocyte, 4-Neutrophil, 5- eosinophil, 6- B-lymphocyte. We have two main categories of WBCs granulocytes and agranulocytes. Neutrophils, eosinophils and basophils are different types of granulocytes, while lymphocytes (Both T-lymphocyte and B-lymphocyte) and monocytes are the agranulocytes.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/87_9117_question_1.png'),
(9119,'biology',86,983,2288,'Read the following statements and Identify which of them are TRUE/FALSE<br>I. Expiration is normally brought about by the relaxation of inspiratory muscles<br>II. Earthworm respires through parapodia<br>III. Carbon dioxide cannot be transported with haemoglobin<br>IV. Oxyhaemoglobin can hold much less carbon dioxide in the form of carbaminohaemoglobin than what deoxyhaemoglobin can<BR>$\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\n{\\rm{I}}&{{\\rm{II}}}&{{\\rm{III}}}&{{\\rm{IV}}}\n\\end{array}$','[{"text": "$\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\rm{T}}&{\\\\rm{F}}&{\\\\rm{T}}&{\\\\rm{F}}\\n\\\\end{array}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\rm{T}}&{\\\\rm{F}}&{\\\\rm{F}}&{\\\\rm{T}}\\n\\\\end{array}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\rm{F}}&{\\\\rm{F}}&{\\\\rm{T}}&{\\\\rm{T}}\\n\\\\end{array}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\begin{array}{*{20}{l}}\\n{\\\\rm{T}}&{\\\\rm{F}}&{\\\\rm{T}}&{\\\\rm{F}}\\n\\\\end{array}$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Earthworm respires through its body surface. $$\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$$ can be transported with haemoglobin as carbaminohaemoglobin. 23% $$\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$$ is transported as carbaminohaemoglobin $$\\left(\\mathrm{CO}_{2} \\mathrm{HHb}\\right)$$.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
