(10173,'biology',89,1287,3108,'The junction between a motor neuron and the sarcolemma of the muscle fibre is called the','[{"text": "Motor unit", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Motor end plate", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Neuromuscular junction (NMJ)", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both (2) and (3)", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'The junction between a motor neuron and the sarcolemma of the muscle fibre is called the motor end plate or neuromuscular junction (NMJ).',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
