(10653,'biology',88,1157,2764,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Our lungs remove large amounts of $$\\mathrm{CO}_{2}(200 \\mathrm{ml}$$ per day) and also significant quantities of water every day.<br></div><div class="column-right">Liver secretes bile containing substances like bilirubin, biliverdin, cholesterol, degraded steroid hormones, vitamins and drugs.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Our lungs remove large amounts of $$\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$$ (approximately $$200 \\mathrm{~mL} /$$ minute) and also significant quantities of water every day. Liver, the largest gland in our body, secretes bilecontaining substances like bilirubin, biliverdin, cholesterol, degraded steroid hormones, vitamins and drugs.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(10655,'biology',9,25,48,'Leafy stage in bryophytes','[{"text": "Attached to the soil through multicellular rhizoids.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Consist of upright, slender axis and bears alternately arranged leaves.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both 1 and 2", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Attached to the soil through unicellular and branched roots", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The second stage is the leafy stage, which consist of upright, slender axes bearing spirally arranged leaves. They are attached to the soil through multicellular and branched rhizoids.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
