(11126,'biology',9,27,50,'In which one of the following male and female gametophytes do not have free living independent existence?','[{"text": "<i>Pinus</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Cedrus</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Gingko</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of them", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'In gymnosperms, sporophyte is dominant, independent and photosynthetic. Whereas, male and female gametophytes are not free living and depend on the sporophyte. Cedrus, Gingko and Pinus are examples of\ngymnosperms.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
