(11132,'biology',9,27,50,'In gymnosperms, the male and female gametophyte','[{"text": "May be born on same or different tree.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Remain within the sporangia retained on parent sporophyte.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Do not have independent free living\\nexistence", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All are correct", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'The male or female gametophyte may be borne on the same or on the different tree. Unlike bryophytes and pteridophytes, in gymnosperms the male and the female gametophytes do not have an independent\nfree-living existence. They remain within the sporangia retained on the sporophytes.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
