(11252,'biology',89,1287,3108,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Red muscle fibres contain abundant mitochondria<br></div><div class="column-right">White muscle fibres contain less amount of mitochondria</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Both the statements are correct.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11253,'biology',9,28,53,'In angiosperms, the cells of embryo sac are','[{"text": "Diploid", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Haploid", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "May be haploid or diploid", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Triploid", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Generally each ovule has a megaspore mother cell that undergoes meiosis to form four haploid megaspores. Three of them degenerate and one divides to form the embryo sac. Thus,the embryo sac and its cells are  haploid too.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11255,'biology',91,1397,3339,'The pituitary gland is located in a bony cavity called','[{"text": "Centrum", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cranium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Sella tursica", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Pars media", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Pituitary gland is located in a bony cavity called sella tursica and is attached to hypothalamus by a stalk.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11257,'biology',9,28,53,'Egg apparatus of angiosperms contain','[{"text": "Two egg cell", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Two synergids", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Two antipodals", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Each embryo-sac has a three-celled egg apparatus – one egg cell and two synergids, three antipodal cells and two polar nuclei.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11259,'biology',91,1397,3339,'The hormones of hypothalamus reach adenohypophysis through','[{"text": "Neurons- dendrites", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Portal blood vessels", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Neuroendocrine cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Arterial circulation", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The hypothalamic hormones reach the anterior pituitary gland through a portal circulatory system - Hypothalamohypophyseal portal circulation and regulate the functions of the anterior pituitary.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11261,'biology',9,28,53,'Secondary nucleus in embryo sac of angiosperm is the product of','[{"text": "Fusion of two synergid cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fusion of two antipodal cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Fusion of two polar nuclei", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Fusion of two egg cell", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Two polar nuclei eventually fuse to produce a diploid secondary nucleus.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11263,'biology',91,1397,3339,'Adenohypophsyis consists of','[{"text": "Pars distalis", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pars media", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pars intermedia", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1 and 3", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Adenohypophysis consists of pars distalis and pars intermedia.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11265,'biology',9,28,53,'Eight nucleated female gametophyte is found in','[{"text": "Bryophytes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Gymnosperms", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Angiosperms", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Pteridophytes", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Embryo sac is the female gametophyte in the angiosperms. It is 7-celled and 8-nucleate structure.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
