(11394,'biology',9,29,52,'Sporophyte, dominant, photosynthetic and independent phase of plant represents','[{"text": "Haplontic", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Diplontic", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Diplohaplontic life cycle", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both (1) and (3)", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The case wherein the diploid sporophyte is the dominant, photosynthetic, independent phase of the plant and the gametophytic phase is represented by the single to few-celled haploid gametophyte is termed as diplontic life cycle.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11343,'biology',89,1287,3108,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> Body parts move when body muscles are arranged in antagonistic pairs.<br><br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> Muscle moves the body part in one direction by its contraction and another muscle moves that part in opposite direction by its contraction.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Antagonistic muscles act in opposition to other muscle if one undergoes contraction, other undergoes relaxation. Example: Flexor and extensor muscles.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11345,'biology',91,1397,3339,'Which of the following hormone stimulates the synthesis and secretion of glucocorticoids?','[{"text": "CTH -Cortex Stimulating Hormone", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "ACTH - adrenocorticotrophic hormone", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "ACTH -adenocorticotrophic hormone", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "GSH - glucocorticois stimulating hormone", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'ACTH - adrenocorticotrophic hormone stimulates the synthesis and secretion of steroid hormones called glucocorticoids from the adrenal cortex.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
