(11359,'biology',89,1285,3106,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> A primary myofilament is made of rod like molecules of protein myosin.<br><br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> Actin and myosin form contractile apparatus.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Large number of filaments are arranged parallelly and are called myofilament (myofibril). Myofibrils have alternate dark and light bands. Actin and myosin are contractile proteins responsible for contraction of muscles.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(11360,'biology',91,1397,3339,'LH in males stimulates the synthesis and secretion of hormones called ____.','[{"text": "Androgens from ovaries", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Androgens from scrotum", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Androgens from testis", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "2 and 3", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'LH stimulates the synthesis and secretion of hormones called androgens from testis',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
