(11378,'biology',9,29,52,'In the life cycle of <i>Chlamydomonas</i>, the zygote divides by','[{"text": "Mitosis", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Meiosis", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Any of these", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Amitosis", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Chlamydomonas is a green algae. It exhibits a haplontic life cycle in which sporophyte is represented by a diploid zygote. Meiosis takes place in the zygote to form four haploid spores. These spores form the haploid gametophyte.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
