(11384,'biology',91,1397,3339,'In females oxytocin ____','[{"text": "Stimulates a vigorous contraction of ovaries at the time of child birth", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Stimulates a slow contraction of uterus at the time of child birth", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Stimulates a vigorous contraction of uterus at the time of child birth", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "1 and 3", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In females, oxytocin stimulates a vigorous contraction of uterus at the time of child birth, and milk ejection from the mammary gland.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
