(11415,'biology',9,29,52,'In bryophytes','[{"text": "Dominant, diploid, multicellular\\nsporophyte alters dominant with\\ndependent gametophytes.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Dominant haploid multicellular\\ngametophyte alters with diploid\\ndependent sporophyte.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both the stages are dominant", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The plant body shows haplontic life cycle.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Bryophytes exhibit haplo-diplontic life cycle. In this cycle, the dominant, independent, photosynthetic, multicellular but haploid gametophyte is the main plant body. It alters with a dependent, multicellular, diploid\nsporophyte.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
