(11658,'biology',9,26,49,'Antherozoids of the both salvinia and Adiantum were released together near the archegonia of Adiantum. Only its sperms enter the archegonia as','[{"text": "<i>Adiantum</i> archegonia retards salvinia sperms", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Salvinia</i> sperms are <i>destroyed</i> by Adiantum sperms", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Adiantum</i> archegonia release chemical to attract its sperms", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "<i>Adiantum</i> sperms travel faster than <i>salvinia</i>", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Archegonia of a particular plant species releases chemical that attracts the sperms of the same species.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
