(11960,'biology',9,27,50,'Read the following statements (A-D) and answer the question which follows them:<br>A. In liverworts, mosses and ferns gametophytes are free-living.<br>B. Gymnosperms and some ferns are heterosporous.<br>C. Sexual reproduction in <i>Fucus, Volvox</i> and <i>Albugo</i> are oogamous.<br>D. The sporphyte in liverworts is more elaborate than that in mosses.<br>E. Both, <i>Pinus</i> and <i>Marchantia</i> are dioecious. Number of correct statements.','[{"text": "Three", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Four", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "One", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Two", "isCorrect": false}]',0,NULL,NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',2013,'AIPMT','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
