(11995,'biology',9,24,44,'Which one of the following is wrongly matched?<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "<em>Spirogyra</em> &ndash; Motile gametes", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "<em>Sargassum</em> &ndash; Chlorophyll c", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<em>Basidiomycetes</em> &ndash; Puffballs", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<em>Nostoc</em> &ndash; Water blooms", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In spirogyra, gamete is non-motile and sexually reproduces by conjugation. Sargassum belongs to phaeophyceae mainly consisting of chlorophyll a and c pigments, Puff balls belongs to Basidiomycetes. Nostoc forms water blooms.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2016,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
