(12022,'biology',91,1397,3339,'The symptoms of a disease include excretion of large amount of urine and increased thirst','[{"text": "Hypersecretion of vasopressin- Diabetes mellitus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Hypersecretion of vasopressin- Diabetes insipidus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Hyposecretion of vasopressin- Diabetes mellitus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Hyposecretion of vasopressin- Diabetes insipidus", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Hyposecretion of vasopressin- Diabetes insipidus is correct.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(12025,'biology',91,1397,3339,'The pituitary gland secretes its hormones into','[{"text": "Portal circulation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Arterial circulation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Venous circulation", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "2 and 3", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The pituitary gland secretes its secretion/ hormones in to venous circulation, as the deoxygenated blooddrains into the veins, hormones will also flow along to the heart.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(12027,'biology',9,28,53,'Functional megaspore in an angiosperm develops into','[{"text": "Ovule", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Endosperm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Embryo sac", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Embryo", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Megaspore is the first cell of female gametophytic generation in angiosperm. It undergoes three successive generations of free nuclear mitosis to form 8-nucleated and 7-celled embryo sac.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2017,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
