(12155,'biology',91,1407,3349,'Which of the following act as secondary messenger except one?','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{IP}_{3}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "cAMP", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "ATP", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'ATP is not a second messenger',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(12157,'biology',9,25,47,'Which of the following statement(s) is/are Incorrect about gemmae?','[{"text": "These are specialised structures by which sexual reproduction take place in liverworts.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "They are green, multicellular and asexual buds.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "They develop in small receptacles called gemma cups.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "They detach from parent body and germinate to form new individuals.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Gemmae are a means of asexual reproduction found in many bryophytes (e.g, liverworts). They are 1 to many celled, specially produced clonal plant fragments. They are green, multicellular, asexual buds which develop in small receptacles (called gemma cups) located on the thalli. Gemmae become detached from the parent body and germinate to form new individuals.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(12158,'biology',90,1333,3216,'After depolarisation, the resting potential of the membrane is restored due to an increase in the membranes permeability to','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{K}^{+}$, leading to its influx", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{Na}^{+}$, leading to its influx", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{K}^{+}$, leading to its efflux", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{Na}^{+}$, leading to its efflux", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'By the end of depolarisation phase, the membrane\'s permeability to $\\mathrm{K}^{+}$increases due to the opening of voltage-gated $\\mathrm{K}^{+}$channels. Within a dfraction of a second, $\\mathrm{K}^{+}$diffuses outside the membrane and restores the resting potential (repolarisation).',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
