(12209,'biology',90,1338,3221,'Match the parts of the brain given in Column I(Parts of the brain) with their functions given in Column II(Functions). Choose the correct option from the following:<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. Medulla oblongata<br>B. Hypothalamus<br>C. Cerebral cortex<br>D. Limbic system</div><div class="column-right">P. Body temperature<br>Q. Olfaction<br>R. Respiration<br>S. Motor function</div></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{A - P,B - R,C - S,D - Q}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A - Q,B - S,C - R,D - P}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A - S,B - P,C - Q,D - R}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A - R,B - P,C - S,D - Q}}$", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'${\\rm{A - R,B - P,C - S,D - Q}}$<br>A. Medulla oblongata - R. Respiration<br>B. Hypothalamus - P. Body temperature<br>C. Cerebral cortex - S. Motor function<br>D. Limbic system -Q. Olfaction',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',2024,'KCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
