(12249,'biology',9,23,40,'Match the column-I (System of\nclassification) with column-II (Characteristics) and choose\nthe correct option<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. Artificial\nsystem<br>B. Natural system <br>C. Phylogenetic\nsystem</div><div class="column-right">P.\nBased on few of\nclassification\nmorphological\ncharacters<br>Q.\nBased on\nevolutionary of\nclassification\nrelationships\nbetween the\nvarious\norganisms<br>R.\nBased on natural\naffinities and\nconsider\nexternal and\ninternal features.</div></div>','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{Q} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{P} ; \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{R}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{P} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{R} ; \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{Q}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{R} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{Q} ; \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{P}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{P} ; \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{Q} ; \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{R}$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Artificial system of classification is based on the few morphological characters. Natural system of classification is based on the natural affinities among the organisms and considers external as well as internal features. Phylogenetic system of classification is based on the evolutionary relationships between the various organisms.',NULL,'Easy','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
