(12883,'biology',94,787,1693,'In Messelson and Stahl\'s experiment<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">${ }^{15} \\mathrm{~N}$ was incorporated into newly synthesised RNA only</div><div class="column-right">The DNA that was extracted from the culture one generation after the transfer from ${ }^{15} \\mathrm{~N}$ to ${ }^{14} \\mathrm{~N}$ medium [that is after 20 minutes; E. coli divides in 20 minutes] had $\\mathrm{N}^{14} \\mathrm{~N}^{14}$</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Statement ${\\rm{A}}{{\\rm{:}}^{{\\rm{15}}}}{\\rm{\\,N}}$ was incorporated into newly synthesised DNA (as well as other nitrogen containing compounds).<br>Statement B : The DNA that was extracted from the culture one generation after the transfer from $^{{\\rm{15}}}{\\rm{N}}$ to $^{{\\rm{14}}}{\\rm{N}}$ medium [that is after 20 minutes; E. coli divides in 20 minutes] had a hybrid or intermediate density.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
