(12894,'biology',94,787,1693,'In Messelson and Stahl\'s experiment heavy DNA molecule could be distinguished from the normal DNA by','[{"text": "Centralisation in a cesium chloride $(\\\\mathrm{CsCl})$ density gradient", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Centrifugation in a cesium chloride $(\\\\mathrm{CsCl})$ density gradient", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Centrifugation in a cesium bromide $(\\\\mathrm{CsBr})$ density gradient", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Centrifugation in a cesium fluoride $(\\\\mathrm{CsFl})$ density gradient", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'DNA replication is a semi conservative process was confirmed by Messelson and Stahl using centrifugation in a cesium chloride $(\\mathrm{CsCl})$ density gradient',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
