(13237,'biology',93,284,542,'In human genetic counseling, which one of the following techniques is employed?','[{"text": "Polyploidy", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Amniocentesis", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Genetic engineering", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pedigree analysis", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Human genetic counseling is the process where the patients with inherited disorder are advised about the consequences and nature of the disorder, prospects of or transmitting it. This is done with the help of the technique Pedigree analysis.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(13238,'biology',96,1161,2776,'In STPs after reduction of the BOD, the remaining major part of sludge is pumped into large tanks called','[{"text": "Anaerobic sludge digesters", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Aerobic sludge digesters", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Biological sludge digesters", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In sewage treatment plant, major part of sludge is is pumped into large tanks called Anaerobic sludge digesters.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(13239,'biology',94,788,1697,'In eukaryotes, the structural gene in a transcription unit could be said as','[{"text": "Monocistronic", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Encoding only one polypeptide per RNA molecule", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Polycistronic", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Structural genes is referred as a gene that controls the production of a definite protein or peptide. In a transcription unit the structural gene can be said as monocistronic especially in eukaryotes whereas in prokaryotes or bacteria it is polycistronic. In eukaryotes each gene is consists of coding exons and interspersed non-coding introns.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(13241,'biology',96,1161,2776,'During sewage treatment biogas produced includes','[{"text": "Methane, Hydrogen sulphide & $$\\\\mathrm{O}_{2}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Methane, Hydrogen sulphide & $$\\\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Methane, Hydrogen sulphide & $$\\\\mathrm{SO}_{2}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Methane, Hydrogen sulphide & $$\\\\mathrm{NO}_{2}$$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Methane, Hydrogen sulphide and Carbon dioxide is called as Biogas. It is inflammable and used as source of energy.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
