(13467,'biology',96,1164,2779,'Which one of the following is active nitrogen fixer of rice fields?','[{"text": "<i>Anabaena</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Nostoc</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "<i>Oscillatoria</i>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of them", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'In India, Aulosira fertilissima is regarded as the most active cyanobacteria for fixing nitrogen in rice or paddy fields.<br>Anabaena: It can be both free-living & symbiotic also.<br>Nostoc: It can be both free-living  & symbiotic also.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
