(13572,'biology',93,278,536,'The map distance between genes A and B is 3\nunits between B and C is 10 units and between\nC and A is 7 units. The order of the genes in a\nlinkage map constructed on the above data will\npossibly be','[{"text": "A, B, C", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "B, A, C", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A, C, B", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "B, C, A", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'According to the linkage maps, the distance between genes A and B is 3 units, between B and C is 10 units and between C and A is 7 units. Therefore the order of the genes on chromosomes is B, A and C.<br>',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
