(13612,'biology',93,278,536,'Find the correct option with respect to Morgan\'s experiments on &nbsp;<em>Drosophila</em>?','[{"text": "Genes white and yellow- 1.3 per cent recombination", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "White and miniature wing- 37.2 per cent recombination", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Genes white and yellow- 37.2 per cent recombination", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both 1 &amp; 2", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Both 1 and 2 options are correct, he found that the genes white and yellow were very tightly linked and showed only 1.3 per cent recombination while white and miniature wing showed 37.2 per cent recombination.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
