(13650,'biology',96,1164,2779,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Nowadays people realised that there is a large pressure to switch to organic farming. <br></div><div class="column-right">Biofertilizers are organisms like cyanobacteria that enrich the nutrient quality of soil.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Organic farming is an agriculture practice which uses renewable resources, causes minimum pollution and maintains optimum yield. Biofertilizers are organisms like cyanobacteria that enrich the nutrient quality of soil.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
