(13722,'biology',96,1163,2778,'Consider the statements (A-D) about organic farming, choose the correct statements<br>A. Utilises genetically modified crops like Bt cotton.<br>B. Uses only naturally produced inputs like compost.<br>C. Doesnot use pesticides and urea.<br>D. Produces vegetables rich in vitamins and minerals<br>','[{"text": "A, C and D", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "B and C", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A and B", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "D and B", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Organic farming is the form of agriculture that relies on techniques such as crop rotation, green manure, vermicomposting etc., to maintain soil productivity and to control pest on a farm. It strictly limits the usage of chemical fertilizers instead it uses biopesticides, bioherbicide and bioinsecticide.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',2011,'AIPMT','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(13724,'biology',93,272,530,'A monohybrid cross is the one in which','[{"text": "A single pair of contrasting characters is considered for the genetic results.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Only a single plant is involved for the experiment.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A hybrid is crossed to a homozygous.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'A monohybrid cross is the one in which a single pair of contrasting characters is considered for the genetic results.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
