(13908,'biology',99,1324,3207,'The organisms which physically and chemically break the complex dead organic remains are known as','[{"text": "Saprotrophs", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Decomposers", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both 1 and 2", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Parasites", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Decomposers (saprotrophs) are the organisms that breakdown degrading dead organic matter or detritus into inorganic substances and in doing, so they carry out the natural process of decomposition.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
