(13911,'biology',99,1324,3207,'Decomposers are also called as','[{"text": "Micro-consumers", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Reducers", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Transducers", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Decomposers are also called as reducers because they are able to degrade or remove the dead organisms. They are also called as microconsumers because of their small body size.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(13912,'biology',98,1188,2847,'Select the correct answer<br>i. Silencing of an unwanted gene - DNA polymerase<br>ii. RNAi - Cellular defence','[{"text": "Only i is correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Only ii is correct", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both are correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None are correct", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Silencing of an unwanted gene could be achieved through the use of RNA interfarence technique.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(13914,'biology',99,1324,3207,'Which of the following is called detrivore?','[{"text": "An animal feeding on a plant", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "An animal feeding on another animal", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "An animal feeding on decaying organic matter", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Plant feeding on an animal", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Detritivores (e.g., earthworm) break down detritus into smaller particles. This process is called fragmentation.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
