(13945,'biology',98,1189,2848,'What is the merit of using the recombinant therapeutics instead of bovine insulin (from cow) in diabetic patients?','[{"text": "It leads to severe hyperglycemia", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It is expensive", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Do not induce unwanted immunological responses", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "It leads to severe hypoglycemia", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Insulin obtained from the pancreas of cattle and pigs, though caused some patients to develop allergy or other types of reactions in response to the foreign protein, therefore recombinant therapeutics are better',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
