(13968,'biology',99,1324,3207,'Which one of the following is not characteristic of humus?','[{"text": "It is further degraded by the process of humification", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "It is colloidal in nature and serves as a reservoir of nutrients", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It is rich in organic matter such as cellulose and lignin\'", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "More than 1 option is correct", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Process of humus formation is Humification. When humus is further degraded by some microbes it releases inorgani nutrients and this process is called mineralization.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
