(14007,'biology',99,1325,3208,'Through which of the following, energy enters the ecosystem?','[{"text": "Producers", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Consumers", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Herbivores", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Primary consumer", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Energy enters ecosystem through producers. The producers are mainly autotrophs, which synthesize organic food from inorganic raw materials with help of solar radiations. It will convert light energy into chemical form',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
