(14047,'chemistry',15,187,412,'The mass of a metal, with equivalent mass 31.75 which would combine with 8 g of oxygen is','[{"text": "1", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "8", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "3.175", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "31.75", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Equivalent mass of metal = 31.75<br>Mass of metal = x<br>Combine with 8 g of oxygen<br>${\\rm{Equivalent}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{mass}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{of}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{metal = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{mass}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{of}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{metal}}}}{{{\\rm{mass}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{of}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{oxygen}}}}{\\rm{ \\times 8}}$<br>i.e., ${\\rm{31}}{\\rm{.75 = }}\\frac{{\\rm{x}}}{{\\rm{8}}}{\\rm{ \\times 8}} \\Rightarrow {\\rm{x = 31}}{\\rm{.75}}$',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',2007,'KCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
