(14247,'chemistry',15,180,398,'Equal masses of ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{,}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{and}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}$ have been taken in a container of volume V at temperature ${\\rm{2}}{{\\rm{7}}^{\\rm{^\\circ }}}{\\rm{C}}$ in identical conditions. The ratio of the volume of gases ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{:C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}$  would be','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{8:16:1}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{16:8:1}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{16:1:2}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{8:1:2}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'According to avogadro’s hypothesis Volume of a gas (V) $ \\propto $ number of moles (n)<br>Therefore, the ratio of the volumes of gases can be determined in terms of their moles.<br>The ratio of volume of ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{:methane}}\\left( {{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}} \\right)$ is given by ${{\\rm{V}}_{{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{V}}_{{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{V}}_{{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}}}{\\rm{ = }}{{\\rm{n}}_{{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{n}}_{{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{n}}_{{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}}}$<br>${{\\rm{V}}_{{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{V}}_{{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{V}}_{{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{{\\rm{m}}_{{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}}}{{{{\\rm{m}}_{{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}}}{\\rm{:}}\\frac{{{{\\rm{m}}_{{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}}}{{{{\\rm{m}}_{{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}}}{\\rm{:}}\\frac{{{{\\rm{m}}_{{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}}}}}{{{{\\rm{m}}_{{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}}}}}$<br>But ${{\\rm{m}}_{{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{ = }}{{\\rm{m}}_{{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{ = }}{{\\rm{m}}_{{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}}}{\\rm{ = m}}\\left[ {{\\rm{n = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{mass}}}}{{{\\rm{molar}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{mass}}}}} \\right]$<br>Thus, ${{\\rm{V}}_{{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{V}}_{{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{:}}{{\\rm{V}}_{{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{\\rm{m}}}{{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{:}}\\frac{{\\rm{m}}}{{{\\rm{32}}}}{\\rm{:}}\\frac{{\\rm{m}}}{{{\\rm{16}}}}{\\rm{ = 16:1:2}}$',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
