(14280,'biology',99,1329,3212,'Select the correct answer<br>A. Contributions of services like recreation and nutrient cycling, are less than 10 percent each.<br>B. The cost of climate regulation and soil formation are about 6 per cent each.','[{"text": "Only A is correct", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Only B is correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both are correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None are correct", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Out of the total cost of various ecosystem services, the soil formation accounts for about 50 per cent, and contributions of other services like recreation and nutrient cycling, are less than 10 per cent each. The cost of climate regulation and habitat for wildlife are about 6 per cent each.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
