(14400,'chemistry',15,186,405,'5 L of an alkane requires 25 L of oxygen for its complete combustion. If all volumes are measured at constant temperature and pressure, the alkane is:','[{"text": "Isobutane", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ethane", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Butane", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Propane", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Since the compound undergoing combustion is an alkane, hence, the combustion reaction can be written as<br>${{\\rm{C}}_{\\rm{n}}}\\mathop {{{\\rm{H}}_{{\\rm{2n + 2}}}}}\\limits_{{\\rm{5}}\\,\\,{\\rm{L}}} {\\rm{ + }}\\left( {\\frac{{{\\rm{3n + 1}}}}{{\\mathop {{\\rm{ 2}}}\\limits_{{\\rm{25}}{\\kern 1pt} {\\rm{L}}} }}} \\right){{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}} \\to {\\rm{nC}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{ + (n + 1)}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{O}}{\\mkern 1mu} {{\\mkern 1mu} _{{\\rm{(1)}}}}$<br>Since volumes are measured at constant T&P, according to Avogadro’s law, $V\\,\\, \\propto \\,\\,n$<br>From eq. (1)<br>$5\\left[ {\\frac{{3n + 1}}{2}} \\right] = 25 \\times 1$<br>$3n + 1 = 10$<br>$n = 1$<br>Thus, the alkane is ${C_3}{H_8}$ i.e., propane.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2016,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(14401,'biology',99,1322,3205,'If in a pond ecosystem, only autotrophs are present and all decomposers and heterotrophs are absent, then what would happen in this ecosystem?','[{"text": "Gradually changes to dense forest", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pond will convert in to barren land", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It remains unchanged", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All living organisms of pond will die, only water will remain", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'All living organisms of pond will die, only water will remain as nutrient cycling will not occur resulting in deficiency for the plants',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
