(14483,'chemistry',45,423,843,'The reported element Meitnerium with atomic number 109 belongs to','[{"text": "s-block", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "p-block", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "d - block", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "f - block", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'109 belongs to d-block element, i.e., ${\\rm{4}}{{\\rm{d}}^{\\rm{7}}}{\\rm{5}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(14451,'biology',98,1190,2851,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> Via recombinant DNA technology transgenic plant production can be achieved.<br><br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> Transgenic organisms are organisms that contains foreign genes and express a transgene.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Transgenic organisms contain genes, that are transferred into them through the genetic engineering. These genes are called transgenes. Using recombinant DNA technology transgenic organisms can be produced.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(14453,'biology',99,1325,3208,'Which group of organism are not constituents of a food chain?<br>i. Grass, Lion, Rabbit, Wolf<br>ii. Plankton, Man, Fish, Grass hopper<br>iii. Wolf, Grass, Snake, Tiger<br>iv. Frog, Snake, Eagle, Grass, Grass hopper','[{"text": "i and iii", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "iii and iv", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "ii and iii", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "i and iv", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Food chain is a sequence of organisms of an ecosystem through which food and energy are passed with each member becoming food for the next member of the chain.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(14454,'biology',98,1187,2846,'Transgenic food crop which may help in solving the problem of night blindness in developing countries','[{"text": "Golden rice", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Bt. Soybean", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Flavr savr tomatoes", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Starlinkmaize", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Golden rice is Vitamin A enriched rice. Therefore with the help of golden rice, the problem of night blindness can be solved.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2008,'AIPMT','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
