(14511,'chemistry',15,187,412,'5.47 g of Mg metal reacted completely with 14.31 g of a non metal. The compound of this non metal with hydrogen contains 3.1% H. The equivalent weight of Mg is','[{"text": "24", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "11.95", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "13.5", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "48", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Weight of Mg = 5.47 g<br>Weight of non metal = 14.31 g<br>Weight of non metal in hydrogen compound = 100 – 3.1 = 96.9<br>14.31 g of non metal contains<br>$\\frac{{{\\rm{3}}{\\rm{.1}}}}{{{\\rm{96}}{\\rm{.9}}}}{\\rm{ \\times 14}}{\\rm{.31 = 0}}{\\rm{.4578}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{g}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{of}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}$<br>Equivalent of Mg ${\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{5}}{\\rm{.47}}}}{{{\\rm{0}}{\\rm{.4578}}}}{\\rm{ \\times 1 = 11}}{\\rm{.95}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
