80b = 114}}{\\rm{.65a + 114}}{\\rm{.65b}}$<br>${\\rm{17}}{\\rm{.35a = 34}}{\\rm{.65b}}$<br>${\\rm{a = 2b}}$<br>${\\rm{a:b = 2:1}}$',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
