(14837,'chemistry',15,186,405,'${\\rm{12}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{L}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{of}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{and}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{11}}{\\rm{.2}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{L}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{of}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}$ are mixed and exploded. Find the composition by volume of mixture (in the order ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{,}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{and}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{HCl}}$).','[{"text": "11.2, 11.2, 22.4", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.8, 0, 22.4", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "0.8, 0.8, 22.4", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.8, 11.2, 22.4", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}\\,{\\rm{ + }}\\,{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}} \\to {\\rm{2HCl}}$<br>${\\rm{1L}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{1L}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{2L}}$<br>${\\rm{11}}{\\rm{.2L}}{\\mkern 1mu} \\,\\,{\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{11}}{\\rm{.2L}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{22}}{\\rm{.4L}}$<br>Volume of ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{ = [12 - 11}}{\\rm{.2] = 0}}{\\rm{.8}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{L}}$<br>Volume of ${\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{ = 0}}$  (As it is limiting reagent)<br>Volume of HCl = 22.4 L',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
