(15052,'chemistry',45,426,852,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> Zinc is placed in 12th group of the periodic table, but is not a d-block element.<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> Zinc has completely filled 3d orbitals in its +2 oxidation state.','[{"text": "If both Assertion & Reason are true and the reason is the correct explanation of the assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "If both Assertion & Reason are true but the reason is not the correct explanation of the assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "If Assertion is true but Reason is false.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "If Assertion is false but Reason is true.", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Zinc is a d-block element. Electronic configuration of ${\\rm{Z}}{{\\rm{n}}^{{\\rm{2 + }}}}\\,\\,{\\rm{is}}\\,\\,\\left[ {{\\rm{Ar}}} \\right]{\\rm{3}}{{\\rm{d}}^{{\\rm{10}}}}$<br>So, the option (4) is correct',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(15054,'chemistry',15,187,410,'250 mL of a sodium carbonate solution contains 2.65 grams of ${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{a}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{3}}}$. If 10 mL of this solution is diluted to one litre, what is the concentration of the resultant solution? (molecular weight of ${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{a}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{3}}}$ = 106 g/mol)','[{"text": "0.01 M", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.001M", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "0.1 M", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{1}}{{\\\\rm{0}}^{{\\\\rm{ - 4}}}}{\\\\rm{M}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'${\\rm{M = }}\\frac{{{{\\rm{W}}_{{\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{a}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{3}}}}}{\\rm{ \\times 1000}}}}{{{\\rm{M}}{{\\rm{W}}_{{\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{a}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{3}}}}}{\\rm{ \\times V(mL)}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{2}}{\\rm{.65 \\times 1000}}}}{{{\\rm{106 \\times 250}}}}{\\rm{ = 0}}{\\rm{.1M}}$<br>When 10 mL of this solution is diluted to 1 L i.e., 1000 mL, concentration decreases by 100 times<br>${\\rm{i}}{\\rm{.e}}{\\rm{.,}}\\frac{{{\\rm{0}}{\\rm{.1}}}}{{{\\rm{100}}}}{\\rm{ = 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{{\\rm{ - 3}}}}{\\rm{M}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{(or)}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{0}}{\\rm{.001}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{M}}$',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
