(15074,'chemistry',15,186,405,'25 kg of ${{\\rm{N}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{(g)}}$ and 5 kg of ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{(g)}}$ are mixed to produce ${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}{\\rm{(g)}}$. The limiting reagent in the production of ${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}$ is','[{"text": "${{\\\\rm{N}}_{\\\\rm{2}}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{N}}{{\\\\rm{H}}_{\\\\rm{3}}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${{\\\\rm{H}}_{\\\\rm{2}}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both ${{\\\\rm{N}}_{\\\\rm{2}}}{\\\\rm{\\\\& }}{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {{\\\\rm{H}}_{\\\\rm{2}}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'${{\\rm{N}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{(g)}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{ + }}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{(g)}} \\to {\\rm{2}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{(g)}}$<br>Mass ${\\rm{25}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{kg}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{5}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{kg}}$<br>Moles: $\\frac{{{\\rm{25 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}}}{{{\\rm{28}}}}{\\rm{ = 0}}{\\rm{.893 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} \\frac{{{\\rm{5 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}}}{{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{ = 2}}{\\rm{.5 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}$<br>According to the equation, 1 mol ${{\\rm{N}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{(g)}}$ requires 3 mol ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{(g)}}$, for the reaction.<br>${\\rm{0}}{\\rm{.893 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}$  mol requires<br>${\\rm{3 \\times 0}}{\\rm{.893 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{mol = 2}}{\\rm{.68 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{mol}}$<br>But we have only ${\\rm{2}}{\\rm{.5 \\times 1}}{{\\rm{0}}^{\\rm{3}}}$ mol of ${{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}$.  Hence, dihydrogen is the limiting reagent in this case.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
