(15228,'chemistry',15,186,405,'The right option for the mass of $\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$ produced by heating $20 \\mathrm{~g}$ of $20 \\%$ pure limestone is (Atomic mass of $\\mathrm{Ca}=40$ )<br>$\\left[ {{\\text{CaC}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{3}}}\\xrightarrow{{{\\text{1200 K}}}}{\\text{CaO + C}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}} \\right]$','[{"text": "$1.76 \\\\mathrm{~g}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$2.64 \\\\mathrm{~g}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$1.32 \\\\mathrm{~g}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$1.12 \\\\mathrm{~g}$<br>", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Weight of impure limestone $=20 \\mathrm{~g}$<br>Weight of pure limestone $\\left(\\mathrm{CaCO}_{3}\\right)=20 \\%$ of $20 \\mathrm{~g}$<br>$=\\dfrac{20}{100} \\times 20=4 \\mathrm{~g}$  <img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/15_15228_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />  $=\\dfrac{4 \\times 44}{100}=1.76 \\mathrm{~g}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2023,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(15229,'chemistry',45,425,846,'Match the Column I with Column II and select the correct answer using given codes.<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. Inert gas element<br>B. Transition element<br>C. Inner - transition element</div><div class="column-right">P. $\\left( {{\\rm{n - 1}}} \\right){{\\rm{d}}^{{\\rm{1 - 10}}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{{\\rm{1 - 2}}}}$<br>Q. ${\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}\\,\\,{\\rm{to}}\\,\\,{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{p}}^{\\rm{6}}}$<br>R. $\\left( {{\\rm{n - 2}}} \\right){{\\rm{f}}^{{\\rm{1 - 14}}}}\\left( {{\\rm{n - 1}}} \\right){{\\rm{d}}^{{\\rm{0 - 1}}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}$</div></div>','[{"text": "A - P, B - Q, C - R", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - Q, B - P, C - R", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A - R, B - Q, C - P", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - Q, B - R, C - P", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'General electronic configuration of<br>(A) Inert gas configuration is ${\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}\\,\\,{\\rm{to}}\\,\\,{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{p}}^{\\rm{6}}}$<br>(B) Transition elements is $\\left( {{\\rm{n - 1}}} \\right){{\\rm{d}}^{{\\rm{1 - 10}}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{{\\rm{1 - 2}}}}$<br>(C) Inner transition elements is $\\left( {{\\rm{n - 2}}} \\right){{\\rm{f}}^{{\\rm{1 - 14}}}}\\left( {{\\rm{n - 1}}} \\right){{\\rm{d}}^{{\\rm{0 - 1}}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}$',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
