(15233,'chemistry',45,426,852,'The element with the lowest atomic number having ground state electron configuration of $\\left( {{\\rm{n - 1}}} \\right){{\\rm{d}}^{{\\rm{10}}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{s}}^{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{n}}{{\\rm{p}}^{\\rm{3}}}$ is placed in the','[{"text": "third period", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "fourth period", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "fifth period", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "sixth period", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'For lowest atomic number of the element, n - 1 = 3 $ \\Rightarrow $ n = 4, hence 4th period.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
