(15649,'chemistry',45,430,858,'Read the Assertion and Reason carefully and mark the correct option<br><br><strong>Assertion:</strong> The first ionization enthalpy of 3d series elements is more than that of group 2 metals.<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> In 3d series of elements successive filling of d-orbitals takes place.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are true and Reason is the correct explanation of Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is true but Reason is false.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is false but Reason is true.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are true but Reason is not the correct explanation of Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'I.E. of $3 \\mathrm{~d}-$ series elements in ${\\rm{kJ}}/{\\rm{mol}}$<br>$\\mathop {{\\rm{Sc}}}\\limits_{631} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Ti}}}\\limits_{656} \\,\\,\\mathop {\\,{\\rm{V}}}\\limits_{650} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Cr}}}\\limits_{653} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Mn}}}\\limits_{717} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Fe}}}\\limits_{762} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Co}}}\\limits_{758} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Ni}}}\\limits_{736} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Cu}}}\\limits_{745} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Zn}}}\\limits_{906} $<br>I.E. values in ${\\rm{kJ}}/{\\mathop{\\rm mol}\\nolimits} \\,\\,of\\,\\,{2^{{\\rm{nd }}}}$ group elements is<br>$\\mathop {{\\rm{Be}}}\\limits_{899} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Mg}}}\\limits_{737} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Ca}}}\\limits_{590} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Sr}}}\\limits_{549} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Ba}}}\\limits_{503} \\,\\,\\mathop {{\\rm{Ra}}}\\limits_{509} $<br>From Sc to Mn , I.E. values are less than that of  ${\\rm{Mg}}({\\rm{Be}}$, a non-metal need not to be considered).<br>So, Assertion is false. Reason is correct.',NULL,'Hard','Assertion and Reason',2023,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
