(16167,'chemistry',46,449,905,'Which element among the following does not form diatomic molecules?','[{"text": "Argon", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Oxygen", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Nitrogen", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Bromine", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Noble gas (He, Ne, Ar, Kr, Xe and Rn) does not form diatomic molecules. Due to presence of completely filled valence shell, these gases are highly stable.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
