(16422,'chemistry',48,752,1620,'2 moles of solid benzoic acid undergoes combustion at $\\mathrm{300 \\mathrm{~K}}$.<br>$\\rm{ \\mathrm{C}_{6} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{COOH}(s)+\\dfrac{15}{2} \\mathrm{O}_{2}(g) \\rightarrow 7 \\mathrm{CO}_{2}(g) \\&+ 3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}(l)}$<br>The value of $\\mathrm{(\\Delta H-\\Delta U)}$ is','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{2.494 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{-1.247 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{1.247 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{-2.494 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'$\\mathrm{\\Delta n=-\\dfrac{1}{2}}$<br>$\\mathrm{\\Delta H=\\Delta u+\\Delta n R T}$<br>$\\mathrm{\\Delta H-\\Delta U=\\Delta n R T}$ <br>$\\rm{ =\\dfrac{-1}{2} \\times 8.314 \\times 300 \\\\ =-1.247 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\text { per mole }}$<br>For 2 moles, $\\mathrm{-2.494 \\mathrm{~kJ}}$',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
