(16462,'chemistry',48,757,1634,'The combustion of one mole of benzene takes place at $\\mathrm{298 \\mathrm{~K}}$ and $\\mathrm{1 \\mathrm{~atm}}$. After combustion, $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{CO}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})}}$ and $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}(l)}$ are produced and $\\mathrm{3267.0 \\mathrm{~kJ}}$ of heat is liberated. The standard enthalpy of formation, $\\mathrm{\\Delta_{f} \\mathrm{H}^{\\circ}}$ of benzene is, Standard enthalpies of formation of $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{CO}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})}}$ and $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}(\\mathrm{l})}$ are $\\mathrm{-393.5 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$ and $\\mathrm{-285.83 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$, respectively.','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{48.51 \\\\mathrm{~kJ} \\\\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{-48.51 \\\\mathrm{~kJ} \\\\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{98.51 \\\\mathrm{~kJ} \\\\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{98.51 \\\\mathrm{~kJ} \\\\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The formation reaction of benzene is given by<br>$\\rm{6 C_{(\\text {graphite })}+3 H_{2(g)} \\rightarrow C_{6} H_{6(l)} ; \\Delta_{f} H^{\\circ}=?}$<br>The enthalpy of combustion of $\\mathrm{1 \\mathrm{~mol}}$ of benzene is:<br>$\\rm{ C_{6} H_{6(l)}+\\dfrac{15}{2} O_{2(g)} \\rightarrow 6 \\mathrm{CO}_{2(g)}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{(l)} ; \\\\ \\Delta_{c} H^{\\circ}=-3267 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1} \\quad \\ldots . \\text { (ii) }}$<br>The enthalpy of formation of $\\mathrm{1 \\mathrm{~mol}}$ of $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{CO}_{2(g)}}$; $\\mathrm{C_{(g r a p h i t)}+O_{2(g)} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{CO}_{2(g)}}$ $\\mathrm{\\Delta_{f} H^{\\circ}=-393.83 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$<br>The enthalpy formation of $\\mathrm{1 \\mathrm{~mol}}$ of $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}(\\mathrm{l})}$ is<br>$\\mathrm{\\mathrm{H}_{2(g)}+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{O}_{2(g)} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{(l)}}$<br>$\\mathrm{\\Delta_{f} H^{\\circ}=-285.83 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1} \\quad \\ldots .(\\mathrm{iv})}$<br>$\\mathrm{6 \\times(i i i)+3 \\times(i v)-(i i)}$<br>we get $\\mathrm{6 \\mathrm{C}_{(\\text {graphite })}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{(\\mathrm{g})} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{C}_{6} \\mathrm{H}_{6(l)}}$;<br>$\\mathrm{\\Delta_{f} H^{\\circ}=48.51 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}$.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
