(16570,'chemistry',49,629,1281,'When $\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$ is bubbled in excess of water, the following equilibrium is established.<br>${\\text{C}}{{\\text{O}}_2} + 2{{\\text{H}}_2}{\\text{O}} \\rightleftharpoons {{\\text{H}}_3}{{\\text{O}}^ + } + {\\text{HCO}}_2^ - {\\text{ ;}}$<br>${{\\text{K}}_{\\text{a}}}{\\mkern 1mu} &nbsp;= {\\text{3}}.{\\text{8}} \\times {\\text{1}}{{\\text{0}}^{{\\text{ &nbsp;- &nbsp;7}}}},{\\text{pH &nbsp;= &nbsp;6}}$<br>What would be the value of $\\dfrac{\\left[\\mathrm{HCO}_{3}^{-}\\right]}{\\left[\\mathrm{CO}_{2}\\right]}$ ?','[{"text": "6", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.0038", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.038", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.38", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'$\\mathrm {[}$ weak acid $\\mathrm {]=\\left[\\mathrm{CO}_{2}\\right]}$<br>$\\rm { {[\\text { salt }]=\\left[\\mathrm{HCO}_{3}^{-}\\right]} \\\\ {\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=K_{a} \\times \\dfrac{[\\text { Acid }]}{[\\text { Salt }]} .}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(16571,'chemistry',46,436,872,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> $\\mathrm{SF}_{6}$ and $\\mathrm{PF}_{5}$ are examples of expanded octet molecules.<br><br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> $\\mathrm{P}$ in $\\mathrm{PF}_{5}$ and $\\mathrm{S}$ in $\\mathrm{SF}_{6}$, are in $\\mathrm{sp}^{3} \\mathrm{~d}$ and $\\mathrm{sp}^{3} \\mathrm{~d}^{2}$ hybridizations respectively.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is incorrect but Reason is correct.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Sulphur and phosphorus can use their d orbital for bond formation. This increases their valence elctron count beyond 8 in their molecules and show expanded octet.<br>Hybridization is not related to expanded octet. So the option (2) is correct .',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
