(16763,'chemistry',48,758,1637,'At a particular temperature<br>$\\rm{\\mathrm{H}_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+}+\\mathrm{OH}_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{-} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{(l)} ; \\Delta \\mathrm{H}=-57.1 \\mathrm{~kJ}}$<br>The approximate heat evolved when $\\mathrm{400 \\mathrm{~mL}}$ of ${\\rm{0}}{\\rm{.2}}\\,{\\rm{M}}\\,{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}\\,{\\rm{S}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{4}}}$ is mixed with $\\mathrm{600 \\mathrm{~mL}}$ of ${\\rm{0}}{\\rm{.1}}\\,{\\rm{M}}\\,{\\rm{KOH}}$ solution will be','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{3.426 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{13.7 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{5.2 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{55 \\\\mathrm{~kJ}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Number of equivalents $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4}}$ taken<br>$\\rm{=\\dfrac{0.2 \\times 2 \\times 400}{1000}=0.16}$<br>Number of equivalents $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{KOH}}$ added $\\mathrm{=\\dfrac{600 \\times 0.1}{1000}=0.06}$<br>Number of equivalent of acid and bases neutralised each other $\\mathrm{=0.06}$.<br>$\\mathrm{\\therefore}$ Heat evolved $\\mathrm{=0.06 \\times 57.1 \\mathrm{~kJ}=3.426 \\mathrm{~kJ}}$.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
