(17667,'chemistry',48,752,1620,'Calculate difference between $\\Delta \\mathrm{H}$ and $\\Delta \\mathrm{U}$ for following reaction at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ ?<br>${{\\text{C}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{H}}_{{\\text{6(g)}}}}{\\text{ + 3}}{\\text{.5}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}} \\to {\\text{2C}}{{\\text{O}}_{{\\text{2(g)}}}}{\\text{ + 3}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{O}}_{{\\text{(1)}}}}$<br>$\\left( {{\\text{R =  8}}{\\text{.314J}}{{\\text{K}}^{{\\text{ - 1}}}}{\\text{ mo}}{{\\text{l}}^{{\\text{ - 1}}}}} \\right)$','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{ - 9}}{\\\\rm{.3 kJ }}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{ - 3}}{\\\\rm{.1 kJ }}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{ - 6}}{\\\\rm{.2 kJ }}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{ - 16}}{\\\\rm{.10 kJ }}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'$\\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{6(\\mathrm{~g})}+3.5 \\mathrm{O}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})} \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{CO}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{(1)}$<br>$\\Delta \\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{g}}=\\mathrm{n}_{\\text {products }}-\\mathrm{n}_{\\text {reactants }}$<br>$\\Delta \\mathrm{n}_{(\\mathrm{g})}=2-4.5=-2.5$<br>According to first law of thermodynamics,<br>$\\begin{aligned}& \\Delta \\mathrm{H}-\\Delta \\mathrm{U}=\\Delta \\mathrm{n}_{(\\mathrm{g})} \\mathrm{RT} \\\\& =-2.5 \\mathrm{~mol} \\times 8.314 \\mathrm{~J} \\mathrm{~K}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1} \\times 298 \\mathrm{~K} \\\\& =-6193.93 \\mathrm{~J}=-6.193 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\approx-6.2 \\mathrm{~kJ}\\end{aligned}$',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',2021,'MHTCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
