(18815,'chemistry',49,632,1293,'A solution is $0.1 \\mathrm{M}$ with respect to $\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}, \\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}, \\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}$ and $\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}$ which will precipitate at lowest concentration of $\\left[\\mathrm{PO}_{4}^{3-}\\right]$ when solution of $\\mathrm{Na}_{3} \\mathrm{PO}_{4}$ is added?','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{A}}{{\\\\rm{g}}_{\\\\rm{3}}}{\\\\rm{P}}{{\\\\rm{O}}_{\\\\rm{4}}}\\\\left( {{{\\\\rm{K}}_{{\\\\rm{sp }}}} = 1 \\\\times {{10}^{ - 6}}} \\\\right)$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{C}}{{\\\\rm{a}}_{\\\\rm{3}}}{\\\\left( {{\\\\rm{P}}{{\\\\rm{O}}_{\\\\rm{4}}}} \\\\right)_2}\\\\left( {{{\\\\rm{K}}_{{\\\\rm{sp}}}} = 1 \\\\times {{10}^{ - 33}}} \\\\right)$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{M}}{{\\\\rm{g}}_3}{\\\\left( {{\\\\rm{P}}{{\\\\rm{O}}_{\\\\rm{4}}}} \\\\right)_2}\\\\left( {{{\\\\rm{K}}_{{\\\\rm{sp }}}} = 1 \\\\times {{10}^{ - 24}}} \\\\right)$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{AlP}}{{\\\\rm{O}}_{\\\\rm{4}}}\\\\left( {{{\\\\rm{K}}_{{\\\\rm{sp }}}} = 1 \\\\times {{10}^{ - 20}}} \\\\right)$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'$\\mathrm{Ag}_{3} \\mathrm{PO}_{4} \\rightleftharpoons 3 \\mathrm{Ag}^{+}+\\mathrm{PO}_{4}^{3-}$<br>$\\left[\\mathrm{PO}_{4}^{3-}\\right]=\\dfrac{K_{\\mathrm{sp}}}{(0.1)^{3}}=\\dfrac{1 \\times 10^{-6}}{10^{-3}}=10^{-3}$<br>(2) $\\mathrm{Ca}_{3}\\left(\\mathrm{PO}_{4}\\right)_{2} \\rightleftharpoons 3 \\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}+2 \\mathrm{PO}_{4}^{3-}$<br>$\\begin{array}{r}4 x^{2}(0.1)^{3}=K_{\\mathrm{sp}} \\\\x=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{K_{\\mathrm{sp}}}{4 \\times 10^{-3}}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{10^{-33}}{4 \\times 10^{-3}}} \\\\=\\sqrt{2.5 \\times 10^{-31}}\\end{array}$<br>$\\mathrm{PO}_{4}^{3-}=5 \\times 10^{-16}$<br>${\\mkern 1mu} (3){\\text{M}}{{\\text{g}}_3}{\\left( {{\\text{P}}{{\\text{O}}_4}} \\right)_2} \\rightleftharpoons 3{\\text{M}}{{\\text{g}}^{2 + }} + 2{\\text{PO}}_4^{3 - }$<br>$\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0.1\\quad \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x$<br>$(2 \\mathrm{x})^{2}(0.1)^{3}=10^{-24}$<br>$4 x^{2}=\\dfrac{10^{-24}}{0.001}=10^{-21}$<br>$x=\\sqrt{2.5 \\times 10^{-22}}=1.58 \\times 10^{-11}$<br>(4) <br>${{\\text{AlP}}{{\\text{O}}_4} \\rightleftharpoons {\\text{A}}{{\\text{l}}^{3 + }} + {\\text{PO}}_4^{3 - }}$<br>${{\\mkern 1mu} \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0.1{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\text{x}}}$<br>${{\\text{x}} = \\frac{{{{\\text{K}}_{{\\text{sp}}}}}}{{0.1}} = \\frac{{{{10}^{ - 20}}}}{{0.1}} = {{10}^{ - 19}}}$<br>$\\therefore$ The correct option is (4).',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
