(18835,'chemistry',49,632,1293,'The ${{\\rm{K}}_{{\\rm{sp}}}}$ of $\\mathrm{Mg}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2}$ is $1 \\times 10^{-12} .0 .01 \\mathrm{Mg}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2}$ will precipitate at the limited $\\mathrm{pH}$','[{"text": "3", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "9", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "5", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "8", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Given, $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{sp}}$ of $\\mathrm{Mg}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2}=1 \\times 10^{-12}$Concentration of $\\mathrm{Mg}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2}=0.01 \\mathrm{M}$$\\mathrm{Mg}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}+2 \\mathrm{OH}^{-}$<br>$\\begin{aligned}& \\therefore \\quad \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{sp}}=\\left[\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{OH}^{-}\\right]^{2} \\\\& \\text { or } \\quad 1 \\times 10^{-12}=0.01 \\times\\left[\\mathrm{OH}^{-}\\right]^{2} \\\\& \\text { or } \\quad\\left[\\mathrm{OH}^{-}\\right]^{2}=1 \\times 10^{-10} \\\\& \\text { or } \\quad\\left[\\mathrm{OH}^{-}\\right]=1 \\times 10^{-5}\\end{aligned}$<br>Again, from $\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{OH}^{-}\\right]=10^{-14}$<br>or$\\begin{gathered}{\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]\\left[1 \\times 10^{-5}\\right]=10^{-14}} \\\\{\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=\\dfrac{10^{-14}}{10^{-5}}=10^{-9}}\\end{gathered}$$\\begin{aligned}& \\because \\quad \\mathrm{pH}=-\\log \\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right] \\\\& \\mathrm{pH}=-\\log 10^{-9}=9\\end{aligned}$<br>$\\therefore \\mathrm{Mg}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2}$ will precipitate at limit $\\mathrm{pH}$ of 9 .',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
