(18942,'chemistry',49,619,1247,'Match Column I with Column II and choose the correct combination from the options given<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Match Column I (Equations) with Column II (Types of process) and select the correct option.</div></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\text{A}} - {\\\\text{P}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{B}} - {\\\\text{Q}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{C}} - {\\\\text{R}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{D}} - {\\\\text{S}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\text{A}} - {\\\\text{R}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{B}} - {\\\\text{S}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{C}} - {\\\\text{Q}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{D}} - {\\\\text{P}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\text{A}} - {\\\\text{S}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{B}} - {\\\\text{P}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{C}} - {\\\\text{Q}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{D}} - {\\\\text{R}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\text{A}} - {\\\\text{Q}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{B}} - {\\\\text{P}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{C}} - {\\\\text{S}},{\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\mkern 1mu} {\\\\text{D}} - {\\\\text{R}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'(1) When ${{\\text{K}}_{\\text{p}}} > {\\text{Q}},$ the reaction goes in forward direction, i.e., the reaction is spontaneous.<br>(2)$\\Delta {\\text{G}} = \\Delta {\\text{G}}^\\circ  + {\\text{RT}}\\,\\,{\\text{ln}}Q,\\Delta {\\text{G}}^\\circ  < {\\text{RT}}\\,\\,{\\text{ln}}\\,{\\text{Q}}$, thus, $\\Delta {\\text{G}} =  + {\\text{ve}}$ and hence, the reaction is non-spontaneous.<br>(3) At equilibrium, ${{\\text{K}}_{\\text{p}}} = {\\text{Q}}$ <br>(4) ${\\text{T}} > \\frac{{\\Delta {\\text{H}}}}{{\\Delta {\\text{S}}}}$ or ${\\text{T}}\\Delta {\\text{S}} > \\Delta {\\text{H}}$<br>This condition is true for spontaneous, endothermic reactions $({\\text{as}}\\,\\,\\Delta {\\text{G}} = \\Delta {\\text{H}} - {\\text{T}}\\Delta {\\text{S}})$.',NULL,'Easy','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/49_18942_question_1.png'),
