(19181,'chemistry',49,617,1242,'Given<br>The following data at $298 \\mathrm{~K}$ :<br>The equilibrium constants for the following reactions,<br>$2 \\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{N}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})$<br>and $\\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g})+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{Br}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{NOBr}(\\mathrm{g})$<br>are $2.4 \\times 10^{30}$ and 1.4 respectively.<br>${{\\rm{K}}_{\\rm{C}}}$  for the reaction is ____. <br>$\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~N}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{Br}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{NOBr}(\\mathrm{g})$','[{"text": "$9 \\\\times {10^{ - 15}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$9 \\\\times {10^{ - 16}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$9 \\\\times {10^{ - 17}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$9 \\\\times {10^{ - 18}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The net reaction is,<br>$\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~N}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{Br}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{NOBr}(\\mathrm{g})$<br>${{\\text{K}}_{{\\text{c(net)}}}} = \\frac{{{\\text{[NOBr]}}}}{{{{\\left[ {{{\\text{N}}_{\\text{2}}}} \\right]}^{1/2}}{{\\left[ {{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}} \\right]}^{1/2}}{{\\left[ {{\\text{B}}{{\\text{r}}_{\\text{2}}}} \\right]}^{1/2}}}}$<br>Considering the given equation:<br>$2 \\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{N}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})$; equilibrium constant $=2.4 \\times 10^{30}$<br>$\\mathrm{N}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g})$; equilibrium constant $=\\dfrac{1}{2.4 \\times 10^{30}}$<br>$\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~N}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g}) ;$<br>Equilibrium constant $ = {\\left( {\\frac{1}{{2.4 \\times {{10}^{30}}}}} \\right)^{1/2}}$ $ = 0.6455 \\times {10^{ - 15}}$<br>$\\dfrac{[\\mathrm{NO}]}{\\left[\\mathrm{N}_{2}\\right]^{1 / 2}\\left[\\mathrm{O}_{2}\\right]^{1 / 2}}=\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}^{\\prime}=0.6455 \\times 10^{-15}$<br>$\\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g})+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{Br}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{NOBr}(\\mathrm{g})$<br>$\\frac{{[{\\text{NOBr}}]}}{{[{\\text{NO}}]\\,\\,{{[{\\text{B}}{{\\text{r}}_{\\text{2}}}]}^{1/2}}}} = {\\text{K}}_{\\text{c}}^{\\prime \\prime } = 1.4$<br>Multiplying both equations<br>$\\frac{{[{\\text{NO}}]}}{{{{[{{\\text{N}}_{\\text{2}}}]}^{1/2}}{{[{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}]}^{1/2}}}} \\times \\frac{{[{\\text{NOBr}}]}}{{[{\\text{NO}}]\\,\\,{{[{\\text{B}}{{\\text{r}}_{\\text{2}}}]}^{1/2}}}} = {\\text{K}}_{\\text{c}}^\\prime  \\times {\\text{K}}_{\\text{c}}^{\\prime \\prime }$<br>$ = 0.6455 \\times {10^{ - 15}} \\times 1.4$<br>${\\text{ or }}\\frac{{[{\\text{NOBr}}]}}{{{{[{{\\text{N}}_{\\text{2}}}]}^{1/2}}{{[{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}]}^{1/2}}{{[{\\text{B}}{{\\text{r}}_{\\text{2}}}]}^{1/2}}}}$<br>$ = {{\\text{K}}_{{\\text{c}}\\,\\,{\\text{(net )}}}} = 0.9037 \\times {10^{ - 15}}$<br>$ = 9.037 \\times {10^{ - 16}}$$ \\approx 9 \\times {10^{ -1 6}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
