(19268,'chemistry',49,625,1269,'The $\\mathrm{pH}$ of pure water at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ and $35^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ are 7 and 6 respectively. The heat of formation ${\\rm{(in \\,kJ}}\\,{\\rm{mo}}{{\\rm{l}}^{ - 1}})$ of water from $\\mathrm{H}^{+}$and $\\mathrm{OH}^{-}$is _____.','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{ + }}$84.55", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$ + 10.5$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$ - 84.55$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$ - 10.5$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'At  $25^\\circ {\\text{C}}\\,;\\,[{{\\text{H}}^ + }] = {10^{ - 7}}$<br>$\\therefore \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{w}}=10^{-14}$<br>At $35^\\circ {\\text{C}}\\,;\\,[{{\\text{H}}^ + }] = {10^{ - 6}}$<br>$\\therefore \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{w}}=10^{-12}$<br>Now using<br>$2.303\\,{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\text{log}}\\frac{{{{\\text{K}}_{{{\\text{w}}_{\\text{2}}}}}}}{{\\,{{\\text{K}}_{{{\\text{w}}_{\\text{1}}}}}}} = \\frac{{\\Delta {\\text{H}}}}{{\\text{R}}}\\left[ {\\frac{{{{\\text{T}}_{\\text{2}}} - {{\\text{T}}_{\\text{1}}}}}{{\\,{{\\text{T}}_{\\text{1}}} \\times {{\\text{T}}_{\\text{2}}}}}} \\right]$<br>$2.303\\,\\,{\\text{log}}\\frac{{{{10}^{ - 12}}}}{{{{10}^{ - 14}}}} = \\frac{{\\Delta {\\text{H}}}}{2}\\left[ {\\frac{{10}}{{298 \\times 308}}} \\right]$<br>$\\therefore \\Delta {\\text{H}} = 84551.4\\,\\,{\\text{cal}}/{\\text{mol}}$<br>$ = 84.551\\,\\,{\\text{kcal}}/{\\text{mol}}$<br>Thus, $\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{H}^{+}+\\mathrm{OH}^{-}$<br>$\\Delta {\\text{H}} =  - 84.551\\,\\,{\\text{kcal}}/{\\text{mol}}$',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
