(19457,'chemistry',49,621,1250,'The following reaction occurs in the Blast furnace where iron ore is reduced to iron metal <br>${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{\\mathrm{Fe}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{3(\\mathrm{~s})}+3 \\mathrm{CO}_{(\\mathrm{s})} \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{Fe}_{(\\mathrm{s})}+3 \\mathrm{CO}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})}}}}$<br>Using the Le-Chatelier\'s principle, predict which one of the following will not disturb the equilibrium.','[{"text": "Removal of ${\\\\mathrm{\\\\mathrm{\\\\mathrm{CO}_{2}}}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Addition of ${\\\\mathrm{\\\\mathrm{\\\\mathrm{Fe}_{2} \\\\mathrm{O}_{3}}}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Addition of ${\\\\mathrm{\\\\mathrm{\\\\mathrm{CO}_{2}}}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Removal of CO", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'For the reaction<br>${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{\\mathrm{Fe}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{3(\\mathrm{~s})}+3 \\mathrm{CO}_{(\\mathrm{g})} \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{Fe}_{(\\mathrm{s})}+3 \\mathrm{CO}_{2(\\mathrm{~g})}}}}$<br>${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}=\\dfrac{\\left[\\mathrm{CO}_{2}\\right]^{3}}{[\\mathrm{CO}]^{3}}}}}$<br>So, addition or removal of solid substances do not affect the equilibrium.<br>The correct option is (2).',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',2024,'JEE Main','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL);
