(19884,'chemistry',55,1234,2973,'Match the following reactants in Column I with the corresponding reaction products in Column II and select the correct answer using the given codes below:<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A  ${\\text{Alkane  + }}{{\\text{X}}_{\\text{2}}}\\xrightarrow{{{\\text{ hv }}}}$<br>B  ${\\text{Alkane + }}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}\\xrightarrow{\\Delta }$<br>C  ${\\text{Alkane  + }}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{2}}}\\xrightarrow{{{\\text{M}}{{\\text{o}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{3}}}}}$<br>D  ${\\text{n - hexane }}\\xrightarrow[{{\\text{10 - 20 atm}}}]{{\\Delta {\\text{,777 K}}}}$</div><div class="column-right">P   Water + carbon  dioxide<br>Q  Alkanal <br>R  Haloalkanes<br>S  Benzene</div></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\text{A  -  P,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{B  -  Q,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{C  -  R,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{D  -  S}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\text{A  -  P,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{B  -  Q,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{C  -  S,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{D  -  R}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\text{A  -  R,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{B  -  P,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{C  -  Q,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{D  -  S}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\text{A  -  R,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{B  -  P,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{C  -  S,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{D  -  Q}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'(A) Halogenation of alkane gives Haloalkanes<br>(B) On combustion of alkane gives $\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$ and $\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}$<br>(C) On oxidation of alkane by $\\mathrm{Mo}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{3}$ gives aldehydes (Alkanal)<br>(D) n-hexane aromatises to give benzene<br>So, the option (3) is correct',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
