(20535,'chemistry',54,1210,2897,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> The configuration of given compound is z. https://res.cloudinary.com/doe6oiv2h/image/upload/v1764953646/preptracker/questions/q_20535_col1_1764953646397.jpg<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> z-configuration shows the presence of bulkier groups at the opposite side of double bond.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Assertion is incorrect but Reason is correct.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In z-configuration, bulkier groups (higher priority groups acc to C.I.P. rules) exist on the same side of double bond. <img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/54_20535_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />  Hence, Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',2017,'AIIMS','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
