(21716,'chemistry',55,1243,3023,'Given below are two statements<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Alkaline $\\mathrm{KMnO}_{4}$ is used to distinguish cyclopentane from propene.</div><div class="column-right">Baeyer\'s reagent is decolourized by propene but not cyclopentane.\n<br>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Propene is an alkene so reacts with Bayer\'s regent. Cyclopentane does not react with Bayer\'s reagent.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
