(21848,'chemistry',58,176,385,'The observed osmotic pressure for a 0.10 M solution of ${\\rm{Fe}}{\\left( {{\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{4}}}} \\right)_{\\rm{2}}}{\\left( {{\\rm{S}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{4}}}} \\right)_{\\rm{2}}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{at}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{2}}{{\\rm{5}}^{\\rm{^\\circ }}}{\\rm{C}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{is}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{10}}{\\rm{.8}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{atm}}$.<br>The expected and experimental (observed) values of Van’s Hoff factor (i) will be respectively: $\\left( {{\\rm{R = 0}}{\\rm{.082}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{L}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{atm}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {{\\rm{K}}^{{\\rm{ - 1}}}}{\\rm{mo}}{{\\rm{l}}^{{\\rm{ - 1}}}}} \\right)$','[{"text": "3 and 5.42", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "5 and 3.42", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "4 and 4.00", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "5 and 4.42", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'${\\rm{\\pi  = iCST}}$<br>${\\rm{i = }}\\frac{{\\rm{\\pi }}}{{{\\rm{CST}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{10}}{\\rm{.8}}}}{{{\\rm{0}}{\\rm{.1 \\times 0}}{\\rm{.0821 \\times 298}}}}$<br>${\\rm{i = 4}}{\\rm{.42}}{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\rm{(observed)}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2014,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
