(22625,'chemistry',60,587,1180,'In a first order reaction, the concentration of the reactant is reduced to $12.5 \\%$ in one hour. When was it half completed?','[{"text": "$20 \\\\mathrm{~min}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$15 \\\\mathrm{~min}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$3 \\\\mathrm{hr}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$30 \\\\mathrm{~min}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'For a first order reaction,<br>$\\begin{aligned}k & =\\dfrac{2.303}{\\mathrm{t}} \\log \\dfrac{[\\mathrm{A}]_{0}}{[\\mathrm{~A}]}=\\dfrac{2.303}{60} \\log \\dfrac{100}{12.5} \\\\& =0.0346 \\mathrm{~min}^{-1}\\end{aligned}$<br>Now $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}=\\dfrac{0.693}{\\mathrm{k}}=\\dfrac{0.693}{0.0346}=20 \\mathrm{~min}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
