(23225,'chemistry',60,585,1176,'For the reaction<br>${\\text{B + 2D}} \\to {\\text{3T, - }}\\frac{{{\\text{d}}{{\\text{C}}_{\\text{B}}}}}{{{\\text{dt}}}}{\\text{ = k}}{{\\text{C}}_{\\text{B}}}{\\text{C}}_{\\text{D}}^{\\text{2}}$<br>The expression for, $\\dfrac{d C_{D}}{d t}$ will be:','[{"text": "${\\\\text{2k}}{{\\\\text{C}}_{\\\\text{B}}}{\\\\text{C}}_{\\\\text{D}}^{\\\\text{2}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\frac{{\\\\text{1}}}{{\\\\text{2}}}{\\\\text{k}}{{\\\\text{C}}_{\\\\text{B}}}{{\\\\text{C}}_{\\\\text{D}}}^{\\\\text{2}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\text{4k}}{{\\\\text{C}}_{\\\\text{B}}}{\\\\text{C}}_{\\\\text{D}}^{\\\\text{2}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\dfrac{1}{4} k C_{B} C_{D}^{2}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Given,<br>$-\\dfrac{d C_{\\mathrm{B}}}{d t} \\text { or }-\\dfrac{d[B]}{d t}=k C_{B} C_{D}^{2} \\operatorname{ork}[B][D]^{2}$<br>According equation,<br>$\\begin{aligned}& -\\dfrac{d C_{\\mathbf{B}}}{d t}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left[-\\dfrac{d C_{D}}{d t}\\right]=k C_{B} C_{D}^{2} \\\\& =\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left[-\\dfrac{d C_{D}}{d t}\\right]=k C_{B} C_{D}^{2} \\\\& \\therefore\\left[-\\dfrac{d C_{D}}{d t}\\right]=2 k C_{B} C_{D}^{2}\\end{aligned}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(23227,'chemistry',58,176,385,'Match Column ${\\text{I}}$ with Column ${\\text{II}}$<br> <br>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "A - R,\\tB - Q ,\\tC - P,\\t\\tD - S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - P,\\tB - R,\\tC - Q ,\\tD - S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - R,\\tB - P,\\tC - S,\\t\\tD - Q", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - R,\\tB - P,\\tC - Q ,\\tD - S", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'$ \\bullet $  van\'t Hoff factor<br> $=\\dfrac{\\text { Normal molar mass }}{\\text { Abnormal molar mass }}$ (A -R)<br>$ \\bullet $  Cryoscopic constant : $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{f}}$ (B - P)<br>$ \\bullet $  Same osmotic pressure $=$ Isotonic solution (C - Q)<br>$ \\bullet $  Azeotropes - Solutions with same composition of vapours above it. (D - S)',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',2023,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/58_23227_question_1.png'),
