(23233,'chemistry',60,584,1172,'The instantaneous rate of disappearance of the $\\mathrm{MnO}_{4}^{-}$ions in the following reaction is $4.56 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{Ms}^{-1}$. Then the rate of appearance of ${{\\text{I}}_{\\text{2}}}$ is:<br>${\\rm{2MnO}}_4^ -  + {\\rm{10}}{{\\rm{I}}^ - } + {\\rm{16}}{{\\rm{H}}^{\\rm{ + }}} \\to $<br>${\\rm{2M}}{{\\rm{n}}^{{\\rm{2 + }}}}{\\rm{5}}{{\\rm{I}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{ + 8}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{O}}$','[{"text": "$1.14 \\\\times 10^{-3} \\\\mathrm{Ms}^{-1}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$5.7 \\\\times 10^{-3} \\\\mathrm{Ms}^{-1}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$4.56 \\\\times 10^{-4} \\\\mathrm{Ms}^{-1}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$1.14 \\\\times 10^{-2} \\\\mathrm{Ms}^{-1}$", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'$-\\dfrac{d\\left[\\mathrm{MnO}_{4}^{-}\\right]}{d t}=1.14 \\times 10^{-2} \\mathrm{Ms}^{-1}$<br>$-\\dfrac{1}{2} \\dfrac{d\\left[M n O_{4}^{-}\\right]}{d t}=+\\dfrac{5}{2} \\dfrac{d\\left[I_{2}\\right]}{d t}$<br>$\\dfrac{d\\left[I_{2}\\right]}{d t}=\\dfrac{5}{2} \\times 4.56 \\times 10^{-3}$<br>$\\dfrac{d\\left[I_{2}\\right]}{d t}=\\dfrac{5}{2}\\left[-\\dfrac{d\\left[\\mathrm{MnO}_{4}^{-}\\right]}{d t}\\right]$<br>$\\begin{aligned}\\dfrac{d\\left[I_{2}\\right]}{d t} & =\\dfrac{5}{2} \\times 4.56 \\times 10^{-3} \\\\& =1.14 \\times 10^{-2} \\mathrm{Ms}^{-1}\\end{aligned}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
