(23237,'chemistry',60,584,1172,'Which of the following expressions is correct for the rate of reaction given below?<br>$5 \\mathrm{Br}^{-}{ }_{(\\mathrm{aq})}+\\mathrm{BrO}_{3(\\mathrm{aq})}^{-}+6 \\mathrm{H}_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+} \\rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{Br}_{2(\\mathrm{aq})}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{(\\mathrm{l})}$','[{"text": "$\\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{Br}^{-}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}=5 \\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{Br}^{-}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}=\\\\dfrac{6}{5} \\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{Br}^{-}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}=\\\\dfrac{5}{6} \\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{Br}^{-}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}=6 \\\\dfrac{\\\\Delta\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\\\right]}{\\\\Delta \\\\mathrm{t}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'For the given reaction,<br>Rate of reaction $=$<br>$\\begin{aligned}& \\dfrac{1}{5}\\left[-\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[B r^{-}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right]=\\left[-\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[\\mathrm{BrO}_{3}^{-}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right] \\\\& =\\dfrac{1}{6}\\left[-\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[H^{+}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right]=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\left[\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[B r_{2}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right]=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\left[\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[H_{2} O\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right]\\end{aligned}$<br>Upon equating the $\\mathrm{Br}^{-}$and $\\mathrm{H}^{+}$, we get<br>$\\begin{aligned}& \\dfrac{1}{5}\\left[-\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[B r^{-}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right]=\\dfrac{1}{6}\\left[-\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[H^{+}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right] \\\\& {\\left[-\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[B r^{-}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right]=\\dfrac{5}{6}\\left[-\\dfrac{\\Delta\\left[H^{+}\\right]}{\\Delta t}\\right]}\\end{aligned}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
