(24102,'chemistry',59,368,681,'The $\\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}$ in the given figure is :<br>','[{"text": "0.5", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.6", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "0.7", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.8", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'$\\mathop {\\rm{C}}\\limits^{ + 5} {\\rm{lO}}_3^ -  + 6{{\\rm{e}}^ - } \\to {\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}^ - }\\,\\,\\,{\\mkern 1mu} {\\kern 1pt} (1)$<br>$\\mathop {{\\rm{ClO}}}\\limits^{ + 1}  + {{\\rm{e}}^ - } \\to \\frac{1}{2}\\mathop {{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_2}}\\limits^0 \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\mkern 1mu} {\\kern 1pt} {\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} (2)$<br>$\\frac{1}{2}{\\mathop {{\\rm{Cl}}}\\limits^0 _2} + {{\\rm{e}}^ - } \\to {\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}^ - }\\,\\,\\,{\\mkern 1mu} {\\kern 1pt} {\\mkern 1mu} (3)$<br>$\\mathop {\\rm{C}}\\limits^{{\\rm{ + 5}}} {\\rm{O}}_3^ -  + 4{{\\rm{e}}^ - } \\to \\mathop {\\rm{C}}\\limits^{ - 1} {{\\rm{O}}^ - }{\\mkern 1mu} {\\mkern 1mu} \\,\\,\\,(4)$<br>$\\Delta \\mathrm{G}_{1}=\\Delta \\mathrm{G}_{2}+\\Delta \\mathrm{G}_{3}+\\Delta \\mathrm{G}_{4}$<br>$6 \\times E_{0}=(1 \\times 0.45)+(1 \\times 1.07)+(4 \\times 0.54)$<br>$6 \\mathrm{E}_{0}=0.45+1.07+2.16$<br>$\\mathrm{E}_{0}=0.613 \\mathrm{~V}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/59_24102_question_1.png'),
