(24106,'chemistry',59,368,682,'Match the columns.<br>Given: \\(\\left(\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{Ag}^{+} / \\mathrm{Ag}}^{\\circ}=0.8, \\mathrm{~K}_{\\mathrm{sp}}(\\mathrm{AgCl})=10^{-10}\\right)\\)<br><div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{P,Q,R; B}} - {\\\\rm{Q; C}} - {\\\\rm{P,S; D}} - {\\\\rm{P,S}}\\\\qquad {\\\\kern 1pt} \\\\qquad $", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{S; B}} - {\\\\rm{Q; C}} - {\\\\rm{P; D}} - {\\\\rm{P,Q,R}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{Q,R; B}} - {\\\\rm{P,Q; C}} - {\\\\rm{P,S; D}} - {\\\\rm{S}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{P,Q,R; B}} - {\\\\rm{Q; C}} - {\\\\rm{S; D}} - {\\\\rm{P,S}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'(A) $\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}=-\\dfrac{0.059}{2} \\log \\dfrac{\\left(\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{H}_{2}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{c}}\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]_{\\mathrm{a}}^{2}}{\\left(\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{H}_{2}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{a}}\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]_{\\mathrm{c}}^{2}}$<br>$\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\circ}=-\\dfrac{0.059}{2} \\log \\dfrac{0.01 \\times(0.1)^{2}}{(0.1) \\times(1)^{2}}$<br>$=\\dfrac{0.059}{2} \\times 3=+\\mathrm{ve}$<br>(B) cell reaction $\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}+\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}=\\mathrm{AgCl}(\\mathrm{s})$<br>$\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}=\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\circ}=-\\dfrac{0.059}{1} \\log \\dfrac{1}{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}\\right]_{\\mathrm{c}}\\left[\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}\\right]_{\\mathrm{a}}}=\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\circ}$<br>$=-\\dfrac{0.059}{1} \\log \\dfrac{1}{0.01 \\times 0.1} \\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\circ}=-0.059 \\times 3$<br>but $\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\circ}=-\\dfrac{0.059}{1} \\log \\dfrac{1}{\\mathrm{~K}_{\\text {sp }}}=0.059 \\times 10$<br>So $=(0.059 \\times 10)-(0.059 \\times 3)$<br>$\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\circ} \\neq 0$ and not conc. cell<br>(C) It is a concentration cell.<br>$\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }} & =\\dfrac{-0.0591}{2} \\log \\dfrac{\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}\\right]_{\\mathrm{a}}}{\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}\\right]_{\\mathrm{c}}} \\\\& =\\dfrac{-0.0591}{2} \\log \\dfrac{[0.1]}{[0.01]}\\end{aligned}$<br>So $\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }} < 0$ (non-working condition)<br>(D) It is a concentration cell with  ${\\rm{E}}{^\\circ _{{\\rm{cell}}}} = 0$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/59_24106_question_1.png'),
