(24418,'chemistry',60,585,1174,'$\\mathrm{aA}+\\mathrm{bB} \\rightarrow$ Product, $\\mathrm{dx} / \\mathrm{dt}=\\mathrm{k}[\\mathrm{A}]^{\\mathrm{a}}[\\mathrm{B}]^{\\mathrm{b}}$. If conc. of A is doubled, rate becomes four times. If conc. of B is made four times, rate is doubled. What is the relation between rate of disappearance of A and that of B ?','[{"text": "$\\\\left\\\\{-\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{A}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}=\\\\left\\\\{-\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{B}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\left\\\\{-\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{A}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}=4\\\\left\\\\{-\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{B}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$-4\\\\left\\\\{\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{A}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}=\\\\left\\\\{-\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{B}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$-2\\\\left\\\\{\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{A}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}=-\\\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\left\\\\{\\\\dfrac{\\\\mathrm{d}[\\\\mathrm{B}]}{\\\\mathrm{dt}}\\\\right\\\\}$<br>", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Rate  $ = \\frac{{{\\rm{dx}}}}{{{\\rm{dt}}}} = {\\rm{K}}{[{\\rm{A}}]^{\\rm{a}}}{[{\\rm{B}}]^{\\rm{b}}}$<br>If [A] is doubled, rate becomes 4 times, means second order w.r.t. A.<br>If [B] is made 4 times, rate becomes 2 times,means $\\dfrac{1}{2}$ order w.r.t. B.<br>$\\Rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{~A}+\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~B} \\rightarrow$ Product<br>$\\Rightarrow-\\dfrac{1}{2} \\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}[\\mathrm{A}]}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\dfrac{-2 \\mathrm{~d}[\\mathrm{~B}]}{\\mathrm{dt}}$<br>$\\Rightarrow-\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}[\\mathrm{A}]}{\\mathrm{dt}}=4\\left(-\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}[\\mathrm{B}]}{\\mathrm{dt}}\\right)$',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
