(24434,'chemistry',59,367,680,'The e.m.f. of the cell in the reaction ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{Zn}_{(\\mathrm{s})}+\\mathrm{Ni}^{2+}(1.0 \\mathrm{M}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{Zn}^{2+}(10 \\mathrm{M})+\\mathrm{Ni}_{(\\mathrm{s})}}}$, is found to be 0.48 V at 298 K . The standard e.m.f. of the cell is ____ V .','[{"text": "0.51", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "0.42", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1.5", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}=\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{o}-\\dfrac{0.0591}{\\mathrm{n}} \\log \\dfrac{\\left[\\mathrm{Zn}^{2+}\\right]}{\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}^{2+}\\right]}}}$<br>$\\therefore \\quad {\\rm{E}}_{{\\rm{cell }}}^\\circ  = {{\\rm{E}}_{{\\rm{cell}}}} + \\frac{{0.0591}}{2}{\\rm{log}}\\frac{{10}}{1}$<br>$ = 0.48 + \\frac{{0.0591}}{2} = 0.51\\,{\\rm{V}}$',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(24435,'chemistry',60,587,1178,'Select the correct statements out of ${\\rm{P, Q}}$ and ${\\rm{R}}$ for a zero order reaction.<br>(P) Quantity of the product formed is directly proportional to time<br>(Q) Larger the initial concentration of the reactant, greater the half-life period<br>(R) If $50 \\%$ reaction takes place in 100 minutes, $75 \\%$ reaction takes place in 150 minutes.','[{"text": "P only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "P and Q only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Q and R only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "P, Q and R", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'For zero order reaction,<br>(i) $[$ Product $]=\\mathrm{kt} \\Rightarrow[$ Product $] \\propto \\mathrm{t}$<br>(ii) $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}=\\dfrac{\\mathrm{A}_{0}}{2 \\mathrm{k}} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2} \\propto\\left[\\mathrm{A}_{0}\\right]$<br>(iii) Equal percentage of reaction occurs in equal time intervals.<br>If $50 \\%$ occurs in 100 minutes then $25 \\%$ occurs in 50 minutes.<br>$\\Rightarrow 75 \\%$ reaction occurs in $100+50=150 \\mathrm{~min}$.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
