(24473,'chemistry',60,587,1183,'Match the Column I with Column II and mark the appropriate choice.<br><div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{S}, \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{R} \\\\quad \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{Q}, \\\\mathrm{D}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{R}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{Q}, \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{S} \\\\quad \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{R} \\\\quad \\\\mathrm{D}-\\\\mathrm{P}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - P,\\tB - Q,R,\\tC - Q,\\tD - S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{S}, \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{R} \\\\quad \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{D}-\\\\mathrm{Q}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Zero order reaction, ${\\rm{x}} = {\\rm{k t}},$ units of<br> $\\mathrm{k}=$ mol. lit ${ }^{-} \\mathrm{sec}^{-}$<br>For second order reaction,<br>$2 \\mathrm{~A} \\rightarrow$ Products<br>${\\rm{K}} = \\frac{1}{{\\rm{t}}}\\left[ {\\frac{1}{{({\\rm{a}} - {\\rm{x}})}} - \\frac{1}{{\\rm{a}}}} \\right]$<br>units of $\\mathrm{K}=$ lit. $\\mathrm{mol}^{-} \\mathrm{sec}^{-}$or $\\mathrm{atm}^{-} \\mathrm{sec}^{-}$<br>For $\\mathrm{A}+\\mathrm{B} \\rightarrow$ Products<br>${\\rm{K}} = \\frac{{2 \\cdot 303}}{{{\\rm{t}}({\\rm{a}} - {\\rm{b}})}}{\\rm{log}}\\left[ {\\frac{{{\\rm{b}}({\\rm{a}} - {\\rm{x}})}}{{{\\rm{a}}({\\rm{b}} - {\\rm{x}})}}} \\right]$<br>units of $\\mathrm{K}=$ lit. $\\mathrm{mol}^{-} \\mathrm{sec}^{-}$or $\\mathrm{atm}^{-} \\mathrm{sec}^{-}$<br>For 1st order reaction, $\\mathrm{A} \\rightarrow$ Products<br>units of $\\mathrm{K}=\\mathrm{sec}^{-}$.<br>$\\mathrm{K}=\\dfrac{2 \\cdot 303}{\\mathrm{t}} \\log \\dfrac{\\mathrm{a}}{(\\mathrm{a}-\\mathrm{x})}$',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/60_24473_question_1.png'),
