(24541,'chemistry',59,373,697,'Time required to deposit $200 \\mathrm{~g}$ of $\\mathrm{Al}$ from an electrolytic cell containing $\\mathrm{Al}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{3}$ using a current of 150 ampere is (approx.)','[{"text": "14296 sec", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "14296 min", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1500 sec", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "15525 sec", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The reaction is, $\\left(\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}\\right)_{2}+6 \\mathrm{e} \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{Al}$<br>$\\therefore \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{Al}}=$ Atomic mass $/ 3=27 / 3=9$<br>Now, $\\mathrm{m}=\\mathrm{E} . \\mathrm{i} . \\mathrm{t} / 96500$<br>$200=\\dfrac{27 \\times 150 \\times \\mathrm{t}}{3 \\times 96500}$<br>$\\therefore \\mathrm{t}=14296.29$ seconds<br>$ \\approx 14296\\,{\\rm{seconds}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(24542,'chemistry',60,585,1174,'The rate constant for the reaction,<br>$2 \\mathrm{~N}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{5} \\longrightarrow 4 \\mathrm{NO}_{2}+\\mathrm{O}_{2} \\text { is } 3.0 \\times 10^{-5} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1} \\text {. }$<br>If the rate is $2.40 \\times 10^{-5} \\mathrm{~mol} \\mathrm{~L}^{-1} \\mathrm{~S}^{-1}$, then the concentration of  ${{\\text{N}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{5}}}$ (in mol ${{\\text{L}}^{ - 1}}$) is','[{"text": "1.4", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1.2", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.04", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "0.8", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'For a first order reaction,<br>$rate = {\\text{k}}\\left[ {{{\\text{N}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{5}}}} \\right]$<br>$2.4 \\times {10^{ - 5}} = 3.0 \\times {10^{ - 5}}\\left[ {\\,{{\\text{N}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{5}}}} \\right]$<br>$\\left[ {{{\\text{N}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{O}}_5}} \\right] = \\frac{{2.4 \\times {{10}^{ - 5}}}}{{3.0 \\times {{10}^{ - 5}}}} = 0.8\\,{\\text{mol}}\\,{{\\text{L}}^{ - 1}}$<br>Note The order of reaction is found from the given units of ${\\text{k}}$. For first order reaction, unit of ${\\text{k}}$ is ${{\\text{s}}^{ - 1}}.$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
