(24605,'chemistry',60,589,1186,'The first order rate constant for the decomposition of ethyl iodide is given by the reaction<br>${{\\text{C}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{5}}}{\\text{I(g)}} \\to {{\\text{C}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{4}}}{\\text{(g)}} + {\\text{HI(g)}}$<br>at $600 \\mathrm{~K}$ is $1.60 \\times 10^{-5} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$. Its energy of activation is $209 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$. What is the rate constant of the reaction at $700 \\mathrm{~K}$ ?','[{"text": "$6.36 \\\\times 10^{3} \\\\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$6.36 \\\\times 10^{-3} \\\\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$6.36 \\\\times 10^{3} \\\\mathrm{~s}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$6.36 \\\\times 10^{-3} \\\\mathrm{~s}$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'${{\\text{E}}_{\\text{a}}} = 209\\,{\\text{kJ}}\\,{\\text{mo}}{{\\text{l}}^{ - 1}} = 209 \\times {10^3}\\,{\\text{J}}\\,{\\text{mo}}{{\\text{l}}^{ - 1}}$<br>${{\\text{k}}_{\\text{1}}} = 1.60 \\times {10^{ - 5}}\\,{{\\text{s}}^{ - 1}},{{\\text{T}}_1} = 600\\,{\\text{K}}$<br>${{\\text{k}}_{\\text{2}}} = ?\\quad {{\\text{T}}_{\\text{2}}} = 700\\,{\\text{K}}$<br>$\\log \\frac{{{{\\text{k}}_{\\text{2}}}}}{{{{\\text{k}}_{\\text{1}}}}} = \\frac{{{{\\text{E}}_{\\text{a}}}}}{{{\\text{2}}{\\text{.303R}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{{{\\text{T}}_{\\text{2}}} - {{\\text{T}}_1}}}{{{{\\text{T}}_{\\text{1}}}{{\\text{T}}_2}}}} \\right)$<br>On substituting the values,<br>$\\begin{array}{*{20}{r}}\n  {\\log \\frac{{{{\\text{k}}_{\\text{2}}}}}{{1.60 \\times {{10}^{ - 5}}}} = \\frac{{209 \\times {{10}^3}}}{{2.303 \\times 8.314}}} \\\\ \n  {\\quad \\left[ {\\frac{{700 - 600}}{{700 \\times 600}}} \\right]} \n\\end{array}$<br>$\\log \\frac{{{{\\text{k}}_{\\text{2}}}}}{{1.60 \\times {{10}^{ - 5}}}} = 2.599$<br>$ \\Rightarrow \\frac{{{{\\text{k}}_2}}}{{1.60 \\times {{10}^{ - 5}}}} = 397.19$<br>$\\therefore {{\\text{k}}_{\\text{2}}} = 397.19 \\times 1.60 \\times {10^{ - 5}}$<br>$ = 6.36 \\times {10^{ - 3}}\\,{{\\text{s}}^{ - 1}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
