(24737,'chemistry',59,374,702,'Match Column I (Cell)  with Column II (Use /property/Reaction)<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A.Leclanche cell<br>B.Ni-Cd cell<br>C.Fuel cell<br>D.Mercury cell</div><div class="column-right">P.Converts energy of combustion into electrical energy<br>Q.Does not involve any ion in solution and is used in hearing aids<br>R.Rechargeable<br>S.Reaction at anode,${\\rm{Zn}} \\to {\\rm{Z}}{{\\rm{n}}^{{\\rm{2 + }}}}{\\rm{ + 2}}{{\\rm{e}}^ - }$</div></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{Q,B}} - {\\\\rm{R,C}} - {\\\\rm{S,D}} - {\\\\rm{P}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{R,B}} - {\\\\rm{P,C}} - {\\\\rm{S,D}} - {\\\\rm{Q}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{P,B}} - {\\\\rm{Q,C}} - {\\\\rm{R,D}} - {\\\\rm{S}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{S,B}} - {\\\\rm{R,C}} - {\\\\rm{P,D}} - {\\\\rm{Q}}$", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Leclanche cell : anode ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{Zn} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Zn}^{+2}+2 \\mathrm{e}^{-}}}$<br>${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{Ni}-\\mathrm{Cd}}}$ cell is rechargeable<br>Fuel cell converts combustion energy into electrical energy.<br>Mercury cell is used in hearing aids and it does not involve any ion in solution.<br>A - S, B - R, C - P, D - Q<br>So, the correct option is (4).',NULL,'Hard','Match the following',2024,'JEE Main','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
