(24804,'chemistry',60,589,1186,'A plot of ${\\mathrm{\\ln k}}$ versus ${\\mathrm{\\dfrac{1}{T}}}$ for a reaction gives the slope ${\\mathrm{-2.0 \\times 10^{3} \\mathrm{~K}}}$. The energy of activation for the reaction is ____ ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}}}$.','[{"text": "16.63", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "20.75", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "26.63", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "8.31", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In a plot of ${\\mathrm{\\ln k \\mathrm{~vs} \\dfrac{1}{\\mathrm{~T}}}}$,<br>$ - $ slope ${\\mathrm{=\\dfrac{\\mathrm{E}_{a}}{\\mathrm{R}}}}$<br>${\\mathrm{2 \\times 10^{3}=\\dfrac{E_{a}}{8.314}}}$<br>${\\mathrm{E_{a}=8.314 \\times 2 \\times 10^{3}=16628 \\mathrm{~J}=16.63 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}}}$',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
