(24856,'chemistry',65,953,2212,'On the basis of the following observations made with aqueous solutions, assign secondary valencies to metals in the following compounds:<br>$\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}<br>&nbsp; \\begin{gathered}<br>&nbsp; \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\mathbf{Formula}} \\hfill \\\\<br>&nbsp; {\\mathbf{precipitated}} \\hfill \\\\&nbsp;<br>\\end{gathered} &amp;\\begin{gathered}<br>&nbsp; {\\mathbf{Moles}}\\,\\,{\\mathbf{of}}\\,\\,{\\mathbf{AgCl}} \\hfill \\\\<br>&nbsp; {\\mathbf{per}}\\,\\,{\\mathbf{mole}}\\,\\,{\\mathbf{of}}\\,\\,{\\mathbf{the}} \\hfill \\\\<br>&nbsp; {\\mathbf{compounds}}\\,\\,{\\mathbf{with}} \\hfill \\\\<br>&nbsp; {\\mathbf{excess}}\\,\\,{\\mathbf{AgN}}{{\\mathbf{O}}_{\\mathbf{3}}} \\hfill \\\\&nbsp;<br>\\end{gathered} &nbsp;\\\\&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; {{\\text{(i)}}\\,\\,{\\text{PdC}}{{\\text{l}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{.4N}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}}&amp;{\\text{2}} \\\\&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; {{\\text{(ii)}}\\,\\,{\\text{NiC}}{{\\text{l}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{.6}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{O}}}&amp;2 \\\\&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; {{\\text{(iii)}}\\,\\,{\\text{PtC}}{{\\text{l}}_{\\text{4}}}{\\text{.2N}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}}&amp;0 \\\\&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; {{\\text{(iv)}}\\,\\,{\\text{CoC}}{{\\text{l}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{.4N}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}}&amp;1 \\\\&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; {{\\text{(v)}}\\,\\,{\\text{PtC}}{{\\text{l}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{.2N}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}}&amp;0&nbsp;<br>\\end{array}$','[{"text": "${\\\\text{i - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{ii - 4,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iii - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iv - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{v - 4}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\text{i - 4,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{ii - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iii - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iv - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{v - 4}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\text{i - 4,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{ii - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iii - 4,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iv - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{v - 6}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\text{i - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{ii - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iii - 6,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{iv - 4,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\text{v - 4}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Number of moles of $\\mathrm{AgCl}$ precipitated denotes number of $\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}$ions, and the primary valency. Therefore,<br>${\\rm{(i)PdC}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{.4N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}$ is $\\left[ {{\\rm{Pd}}{{\\left( {{\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}} \\right)}_{\\rm{4}}}} \\right]{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}$, secondary valency is 4.<br>${\\rm{(ii)NiC}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{.6}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{O}}$ is $\\left[ {{\\rm{Ni}}{{\\left( {{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{O}}} \\right)}_{\\rm{6}}}} \\right]{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}$, secondary valency is 6.<br>${\\rm{(iii)}}\\,{\\rm{PtC}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{4}}}{\\rm{.2N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}$ is $\\left[ {{\\rm{Pt}}{{\\left( {{\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}} \\right)}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{4}}}} \\right]$ with secondary valency of zero.<br>${\\rm{(iv)}}\\,{\\rm{CoC}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{3}}}{\\rm{.4N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}$ is $\\left[ {{\\rm{Co}}{{\\left( {{\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}} \\right)}_{\\rm{4}}}{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}} \\right]{\\rm{Cl}}$ having secondary valency of 6.<br>${\\rm{(v)}}\\,{\\rm{PtC}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{.2N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}$ is $\\left[ {{\\rm{Pt}}{{\\left( {{\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{3}}}} \\right)}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{C}}{{\\rm{l}}_{\\rm{2}}}} \\right]$, secondary valency of zero.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
