(24863,'chemistry',60,587,1179,'In the case of a first order reaction, the time required for $93.75 \\%$ of reaction to take place is x times that required for half of the reaction. Find the value of x.','[{"text": "0.5", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "2", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "3", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "4", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'${{\\text{t}}_{1/2}} = \\frac{{0.0693}}{{\\text{k}}}$<br>Also,<br>${t_{93.75}} = \\frac{{2.303}}{k}\\log \\frac{{100}}{{100 - 93.75}}$<br>$ = \\frac{{2.303}}{k}\\log \\frac{{100}}{{6.25}} = \\frac{{2.303}}{k}\\log {2^4}$<br>${\\rm{ }} = \\frac{{4 \\times 2.303 \\times \\log 2}}{{\\rm{k}}} = \\frac{{4 \\times 0.693}}{{\\rm{k}}}$<br>$ = 4{{\\rm{t}}_{1/2}}\\left( {{{\\rm{t}}_{1/2}} = \\frac{{0.693}}{{\\rm{k}}}} \\right)$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
