(25158,'chemistry',63,808,1754,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> $\\mathrm{NH}_{3}$ and $\\mathrm{PH}_{3}$ differ from each other in their reaction with $\\mathrm{CuSO}_{4}$ or $\\mathrm{AgNO}_{3}$.<br><br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> $\\mathrm{PH}_{3}$ acts as oxidising agent in these reactions but $\\mathrm{NH}_{3}$ does not.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Assertion is incorrect but reason is correct.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'<br>$\\left.\\left.\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{CuSO}_{4}+4 \\mathrm{NH}_{3} \\longrightarrow\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\\right)_{4}\\right] \\mathrm{SO}_{4} \\\\\\mathrm{AgNO}_{3}+2 \\mathrm{NH}_{3} \\longrightarrow\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\\right)_{2}\\right] \\mathrm{NO}_{3}\\end{array}\\right\\} \\begin{array}{l}\\text { Complex } \\\\\\text { formation } \\\\3 \\mathrm{CuSO}_{4}+2 \\mathrm{PH}_{3} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Cu}_{3} \\mathrm{P}_{2}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4} \\\\3 \\mathrm{AgNO}_{3}+\\mathrm{PH}_{3} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Ag}_{3} \\mathrm{P}+3 \\mathrm{HNO}_{3}\\end{array}\\right\\} \\text { Precipitation }$<br>So, the (3) is correct.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
