(25468,'chemistry',65,958,2232,'Which of the following statements is correct?','[{"text": "If ${{\\\\rm{\\\\Delta }}_{\\\\rm{^\\\\circ }}}{\\\\rm{ < P}}$, low spin state is more stable.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{CO}$ is a very weak ligand.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The colour of a complex depends only on the nature of metal ion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Tetrahedral complexes have nearly $50 \\\\%$ CFSE value than octahedral complexes.", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'If  ${\\text{P < }}$$\\Delta_{0}$,  low spin state is more stable, Hence, (1) is wrong, $\\mathrm{CO}$ is a very strong ligand. Hence, (2) is wrong. The colour of the complex depends not only on the metal ion but also on the nature of the ligand. Hence. (3) is wrong.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
