(25570,'chemistry',64,191,1917,'Match the metal ions given in Column I with the spin magnetic moments of the ions given in Column II and assign the correct code :<br><div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. $\\rm{C{o^{3 + }}}$<br>B.$\\rm{C{r^{3 + }}}$<br>C.$\\rm{F{e^{3 + }}}$<br>D.$\\rm{N{i^{2 + }}}$</div><div class="column-right">P.  $\\rm{\\sqrt 8 \\,B.M}$<br>Q.  $\\rm{\\sqrt {35} \\,B.M}$<br>R.  $\\rm{\\sqrt 3 \\,B.M}$<br>S.  $\\rm{\\sqrt {24} \\,B.M}$<br>T.  $\\rm{\\sqrt {15} \\,B.M}$</div></div>','[{"text": "A - S, B - P, C - Q, D - R", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - R, B - T, C - P, D - Q", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - P, B - Q, C - R, D - S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - S, B - T, C - Q, D - P", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'<br>Magnetic moment, $\\mathrm{\\mu=\\sqrt{n(n+2)}}$ B.M.<br>Where, $\\mathrm{\\mathrm{n}=}$ no. of unpaired electrons<br>$\\rm{Co^{3+} \\Rightarrow 4=\\sqrt{4(4+2)}=\\sqrt{24} \\\\ C r^{3+} \\Rightarrow 3=\\sqrt{3(3+2)}=\\sqrt{15} \\\\ F e^{3+} \\Rightarrow 5=\\sqrt{5(5+2)}=\\sqrt{35} \\\\ N i^{2+} \\Rightarrow 2=\\sqrt{2(2+2)}=\\sqrt{8}}$',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',2018,'NEET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
