}}_{\\rm{7}}}{\\rm{ + }}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{S}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{4}}}{\\rm{ + 3S}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{2}}} \\to $<br>${{\\rm{K}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{S}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{4}}}{\\rm{ + C}}{{\\rm{r}}_{\\rm{2}}}{{\\rm{(S}}{{\\rm{O}}_{\\rm{4}}}{\\rm{)}}_{\\rm{3}}}{\\rm{ + }}{{\\rm{H}}_{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{O}}$<br>$\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\left( {\\rm{C}} \\right)$<br>$\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\rm{Green}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2010,'KCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(25668,'chemistry',65,959,2237,'The complex exhibits lowest energy absorption band is:','[{"text": "$\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{NiCl}_{4}\\\\right]^{2-}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{Ni}(\\\\mathrm{CO})_{4-}\\\\right]$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{Ni}(\\\\mathrm{CN})_{4}\\\\right]^{2-}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\left[\\\\mathrm{Ni}\\\\left(\\\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\\\mathrm{O}\\\\right)_{6}\\\\right]^{2+}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Order of CFSE $(\\Delta)$<br>$$\\underset{\\text { (Tetrahedral) }}{\\Delta_{t}} < \\underset{\\text { (Octahedral) }}{\\Delta_{0}} < \\underset{\\text { (Square planar) }}{\\Delta_{s p}}$$<br>Absorb energy $=\\Delta$<br>$\\left[\\mathrm{NiCl}_{4}\\right]^{2-}$ and $\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CO})_{4}\\right]$ have tetrahedral geometry. So, they have low absorption energy. $\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}$is a weaker ligand than $\\mathrm{CO}$ hence, $\\left[\\mathrm{NiCl}_{4}\\right]^{2-}$ exhibits lower energy absorption band.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
