(26329,'chemistry',64,192,1924,'Potassium dichromate acts as a strong oxidising agent in acidic solution. During this process, the oxidation state changes from','[{"text": "$+ 6$ to $+ 3$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$+ 3$ to$+ 1$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$+ 6$ to $+ 2$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$+ 2$ to $+ 1$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In acidic medium,<br>$\\stackrel{+6}{\\mathrm{Cr}_{2}} \\mathrm{O}_{7}^{2-}+14 \\mathrm{H}^{+}+6 \\mathrm{e}^{-} \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{Cr}^{+3}+7 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}$<br>The oxidation state changes from $+ 6$ to $+ 3$ .',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2023,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
