(26458,'chemistry',64,191,1918,'d - d transition is not a reason for the colour of which of the following compounds?','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{FeI}_{3}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{CrCl}_{3}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{PbI}_{2}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Pb is a p - block metal. So d-d transition is  not observed here.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
