(26502,'chemistry',65,959,2237,'Correct increasing order for the wavelength of Sabsorption in the visible region for the complexes of $\\mathrm{Co}^{3+}$ is','[{"text": "${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{({\\\\text{CN}})}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 - }},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 + }},$<br>${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}\\\\left( {{{\\\\text{H}}_2}{\\\\text{O}}} \\\\right)} \\\\right]^{3 + }},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}{\\\\text{Cl}}} \\\\right]^{ + 2}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{({\\\\text{CN}})}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 - }},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}\\\\left( {{{\\\\text{H}}_2}{\\\\text{O}}} \\\\right)} \\\\right]^{3 + }},$<br>${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}{\\\\text{Cl}}} \\\\right]^{2 + }},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 + }}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 + }},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{({\\\\text{CN}})}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 - }},$<br>${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}\\\\left( {{{\\\\text{H}}_2}{\\\\text{O}}} \\\\right)} \\\\right]^{3 + }},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}{\\\\text{Cl}}} \\\\right]^{ + 2}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}{\\\\text{Cl}}} \\\\right]^{ + 2}},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_5}\\\\left( {{{\\\\text{H}}_2}{\\\\text{O}}} \\\\right)} \\\\right]^{3 + }}$<br>${\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{\\\\left( {{\\\\text{N}}{{\\\\text{H}}_3}} \\\\right)}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 + }},{\\\\left[ {{\\\\text{Co}}{{({\\\\text{CN}})}_6}} \\\\right]^{3 - }}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The wavelength of absorption in visible region for a complex depends on the nature of ligand, i.e. stronger be the ligand (i.e. higher the value of $\\Delta_{0}$ ) lower is the wavelength.<br>$\\therefore$ Strength of ligands in the spectrochemical series are in order:<br>$\\mathrm{CN}^{-}>\\mathrm{NH}_{3}>\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}>\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}$.<br>Therefore, the correct increasing order for wavelength of absorption is,<br>$\\begin{aligned}& {\\left[\\mathrm{Co}(\\mathrm{CN})_{6}\\right]^{3-},\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\\right)_{6}\\right]^{3+},} \\\\& {\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\\right)_{5}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}\\right)\\right]^{3+},\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\\right)_{5} \\mathrm{Cl}\\right]^{2+}}\\end{aligned}$<br>Thus, option (1) is the correct.<br>',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2019,'AIIMS','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
