(27107,'chemistry',66,1031,2437,'Consider the reactions,<br>(I) $\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_{3}\\right)_{2} \\mathrm{CH}-\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{Br} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{OH}}$<br>$\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_{3}\\right)_{2} \\mathrm{CH}-\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{OC}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{5}+\\mathrm{HBr}$<br>(II) $\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_{3}\\right)_{2} \\mathrm{CH}-\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{Br} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{O}^{-}}$<br>${\\left( {{\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_3}} \\right)_2}{\\text{CH}} - {\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_2}{\\text{O}}{{\\text{C}}_2}{{\\text{H}}_5} + {\\text{B}}{{\\text{r}}^ - }$<br>The mechanisms of reactions (I) and (II) are respectively','[{"text": "${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}1$ and ${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}2$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}1$ and ${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}1$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}2$ and ${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}2$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}2$ and ${{\\\\text{S}}_{\\\\text{N}}}1$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'$\\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{OH}$ being a weaker nucleophile and a polar protic solvent favours $\\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{N}} 1$ mechanism while $\\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{O}^{-}$being a strong nucleophile favours $\\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{N}} 2$ mechanism.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
