s elimination with base.<br>$$\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_{3}\\right)_{3} \\mathrm{CBr}+\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{COOAg}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\longrightarrow$$  <img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/67_27153_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
