(27191,'chemistry',67,1084,2608,'An organic compound $$\\mathrm{C}_{3} \\mathrm{H}_{6} \\mathrm{O}$$ does not give a precipitate with 2, 4-dinitrophenyl hydrazine reagent and does not react with sodium metal. It could be','[{"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{CH}_{3}-\\\\mathrm{CH}_{2}-\\\\mathrm{CHO}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{CH}_{3}-\\\\mathrm{CO}-\\\\mathrm{CH}_{3}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{CH}_{2}=\\\\mathrm{CH}-\\\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{OH}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{CH}_{2}=\\\\mathrm{CH}-\\\\mathrm{OCH}_{3}$$", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'It is neither a carbonyl compound (do not give test with hydrazine) nor an alcohol and thus it may be ether',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
