(27464,'chemistry',66,1031,2433,'Read the Assertion and Reason carefully to mark the correct option out of the options given below.<br><br><strong>Assertion:</strong> ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{N}} 2}}$ reaction of ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{C}_{6} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{Br}}}$ occurs more readily than the ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{N}} 2}}$ reaction of$\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{Br} \\text {. }$<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> The partially bonded unhybridized p-orbital that develops in the trigonal bipyramidal transition sate is stabilized by conjugation with the phenyl ring.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is incorrect but reason is correct.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'<img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/66_27464_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' /> <br>So, the correct option is (1) .',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',2024,'JEE Main','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
