ight)_{6}\\right]^{2+},\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}\\right)_{6}\\right]^{3+},\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}\\right)_{6}\\right]^{+2}$<br>So, the correct option is (1).',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2024,'JEE Main','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
