(27838,'chemistry',65,957,2228,'Match Column I with Column II<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{P,B}} - {\\\\rm{R,C}} - {\\\\rm{Q,D}} - {\\\\rm{S}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{R,B}} - {\\\\rm{P,C}} - {\\\\rm{S,D}} - {\\\\rm{Q}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{R,B}} - {\\\\rm{Q,C}} - {\\\\rm{S,D}} - {\\\\rm{P}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{R,B}} - {\\\\rm{P,C}} - {\\\\rm{Q,D}} - {\\\\rm{S}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{K}_{2}\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CN})_{4}\\right]}}$<br>Metal ion ${\\mathrm{-\\mathrm{Ni}^{2+}}}$<br>Electronic configuration ${\\mathrm{-3 d^{8}}}$<br>Ligand - strong<br>Hybridisation - dsp ${\\mathrm{^{2}}}$ (A-R)<br>${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CO})_{4}}}$<br>Metal ${\\mathrm{-\\mathrm{Ni}(0)}}$<br>Electronic configuration ${\\mathrm{-3 \\mathrm{~d}^{8} 4 \\mathrm{~s}^{2}}}$<br>Ligand - strong<br>Hybridisation ${\\mathrm{-\\mathrm{sp}^{3}(\\mathrm{~B}-\\mathrm{P})}}$ <br>${\\mathrm{\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\\right)_{6}\\right] \\mathrm{Cl}_{3}}}$<br>Metal ion ${\\mathrm{-\\mathrm{Co}^{3+}}}$<br>Electronic configuration ${\\mathrm{-3 \\mathrm{~d}^{6}}}$<br>Ligand - strong<br>Hybridisation ${\\mathrm{-\\mathrm{d}^{2} \\mathrm{sp}^{3}(\\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{S})}}$<br>${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{Na}_{3}\\left[\\mathrm{CoF}_{6}\\right]}}$<br>Metal ion ${\\mathrm{-\\mathrm{Co}^{3+}}}$<br>Electronic configuration ${\\mathrm{-3 \\mathrm{~d}^{6}}}$<br>Ligand - Weak<br>Hybridisation ${\\mathrm{-\\mathrm{sp}^{3} \\mathrm{~d}^{2}}}$ (D-Q)<br>So, the correct option is (2).',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',2024,'JEE Main','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/65_27838_question_1.png'),
