(27887,'chemistry',67,1073,2559,'The mechanism of the reaction involves the following three steps.<br>I. Nucleophilic attack of water on carbocation.<br>II. Protonation of an alkene to form carbocation by the electrophilic attack of $$\\mathrm{H}_{3} \\mathrm{O}^{+}$$.<br>III. Deprotonation to form an alcohol.<br>Identify the correct sequence for the mechanism of reaction in the acid catalysed hydration of alkenes.','[{"text": "I, II and III", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "II, I and III", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "III, I and II", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "III, II and I", "isCorrect": false}]',1,NULL,NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(27842,'chemistry',65,959,2237,'Read the Statement - A and Statement - B carefully to mark the correct options given below<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A solution of ${\\mathrm{\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}\\right)_{6}\\right]^{2+}}}$ is green in colour</div><div class="column-right">A solution of ${\\mathrm{\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CN})_{4}\\right]^{2-}}}$ is colourless.</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'${\\mathrm{\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}\\right)_{6}\\right]^{2+}}}$ has 2 unpaired electrons.Due to weak ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}}}$ ligands, therefore, absorb light for d-d transition from visible region and radiate complementary colour i.e., green.<br>Whereas ${\\mathrm{\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CN})_{4}\\right]^{2-}}}$ does not have any unpaired electron due to strong ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{CN}^{-}}}$ligand, therefore does not absorb light from visible region hence, it is colourless. So, the correct option is (3).',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',2024,'JEE Main','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
