(27980,'chemistry',68,1113,2669,'Which of the following organic compounds answers to both Iodoform test and Fehling\'s test?','[{"text": "Ethanal", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Propanone", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ethanol", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Methanal", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Acetaldehyde (ethanal) gives red ppt. with Fehling solution.<br>$$\\begin{array}{r}\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{CHO}+\\underset{\\text { Fehling solution }}{2 \\mathrm{Cu}(\\mathrm{OH})_{2}}+2 \\mathrm{NaOH} \\rightarrow \\\\\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{COONa}+\\underset{\\text { Red ppt. }}{\\mathrm{Cu}_{2} \\mathrm{O}}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}\\end{array}$$<br>Ethanal also gives yellow ppt. with an alkaline solution of iodine (Iodoform test).<br>$$\\begin{aligned}& \\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{CHO}+4 \\mathrm{NaOH}+3 \\mathrm{I}_{2} \\rightarrow \\\\& \\underset{\\text { Yellow ppt. }}{\\mathrm{CHI}_{3}}+\\mathrm{HCOONa}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}+3 \\mathrm{NaI}\\end{aligned}$$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2008,'KCET','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
