(28166,'chemistry',68,1118,2678,'I. $$\\mathrm{RCOOH}+\\mathrm{PCl}_{5} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{RCOCl}+\\mathrm{POCl}_{3}+\\mathrm{HCl}$$<br>II. $3{\\rm{RCOOH}} + {\\rm{PC}}{{\\rm{l}}_3} \\to 3{\\rm{RCOCl}} + {{\\rm{H}}_3}{\\rm{P}}{{\\rm{O}}_3}$<br>III. $$\\mathrm{RCOOH}+\\mathrm{SOCl}_{2} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{RCOCl}+\\mathrm{SO}_{2}+\\mathrm{HCl}$$<br>Which of the above reactions is/are preferred for the synthesis of $$\\mathrm{RCOCl}$$ ?','[{"text": "Only I", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Only II", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Only III", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "All of these", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'$$\\mathrm{RCOOH}+\\mathrm{SOCl}_{2} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{RCOCl}+\\mathrm{POCl}_{3}+\\mathrm{HCl}$$<br>$$3 \\mathrm{RCOOH}+\\mathrm{PCl}_{5} \\rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{RCOCl}+\\mathrm{H}_{3} \\mathrm{PO}_{3}$$<br>$$\\mathrm{RCOOH}+\\mathrm{SOCl}_{2} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{RCOCl}+\\mathrm{SO}_{2}+\\mathrm{HCl}$$<br>Thionly chloride is preferred because the other two products are gaseous and escape from the reaction mixture making the purification of the products easier.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
