(28197,'chemistry',68,1118,2677,'The correct decreasing order for acid strength is','[{"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{FCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{NCCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>$$ $$\\\\mathrm{NO}_{2} \\\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{ClCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{CNCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{O}_{2} \\\\mathrm{NCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>$$ $$\\\\mathrm{FCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{ClCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}$$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{NO}_{2} \\\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{NCCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>$$ $$\\\\mathrm{FCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{ClCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}$$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$$\\\\mathrm{NO}_{2} \\\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{FCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>$$ $$\\\\mathrm{CNCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}>\\\\mathrm{ClCH}_{2} \\\\mathrm{COOH}$$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Order of electron withdrawing effect exerting group is $$-\\mathrm{NO}_{2}>-\\mathrm{CN}>\\mathrm{F}>-\\mathrm{Cl}$$.<br>Hence, the acid strength order is<br>$$\\mathrm{NO}_{2} \\mathrm{NCH}_{2} \\mathrm{COOH}>\\mathrm{NCCH}_{2} \\mathrm{COOH}>$$<br>$$\\mathrm{FCH}_{2} \\mathrm{COOH}>\\mathrm{ClCH}_{2} \\mathrm{COOH}$$.<br>acidic strength ${\\rm{\\alpha }}\\frac{{\\rm{1}}}{{{\\rm{ - \'I\'}}\\,\\,{\\rm{effect}}}}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',2019,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
