(28440,'chemistry',68,1118,2685,'${\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{ - C}} \\equiv {\\text{C - }}{{\\text{C}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{5}}}\\frac{{{\\text{1}}{\\text{.}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{/Cl}}{{\\text{l}}_{\\text{4}}}}}{{2 \\cdot {{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{O}}}}{\\text{A + B}}$.<br>Product (A) forms polymer in liquid phase and forms dimer in Dry benzene. Product (B) gives $$\\mathrm{C}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{COOCH}_{3}$$ when reacts with Methanol. The molecular weight difference between A & $$\\mathrm{B}$$ is','[{"text": "12", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "14", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "16", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "18", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'${\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}} - {\\text{C}} \\equiv {\\text{C}} - {{\\text{C}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{5}}}\\xrightarrow[{{\\text{2}}{\\text{.}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}}{\\text{O}}}]{{{\\text{1}}{\\text{.}}{{\\text{O}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{/CC}}{{\\text{l}}_{\\text{4}}}}}\\mathop {{\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{COOH + }}}\\limits_{{\\text{ (A) }}} $<br>$\\mathop {{{\\text{C}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{5}}}{\\text{COOH}}}\\limits_{{\\text{(B)}}} \\xrightarrow[{{\\text{C}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}{\\text{OH}}}]{{{{\\text{H}}^{\\text{ + }}}}}{{\\text{C}}_{\\text{2}}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{5}}}{\\text{COOC}}{{\\text{H}}_{\\text{3}}}$<br>M.W. of ${\\rm{A = 60}}$<br>M.W. of ${\\rm{B = 74}}$<br>Difference in M.w. = 14',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
